<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Akebou: La Bible en akebou</book>
  <para style="h">Marǝko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marǝko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marǝko le Dieceeceerǝ we ŋ na ŋʊrʊ wǝ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marǝko</para>
  <para style="mt2">le Dieceeceerǝ we ŋ na ŋʊrʊ wǝ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ŋwaataanǝtierǝ</para>
  <para style="ip">Kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa kǝ ya kǝ láa wɛɛlɩ kǝ ŋ ru rǝ Yesu le Dieceeceerǝ we. Marǝko ŋ na ŋʊrʊ kǝ. Marǝko lee ri Yesu le Nyikpiiyǝ. Paape yeli anǝnɛyǝ mǝ Pɔlʊ mǝ Banaba kpɛŋ (Anǝnɛyeeyǝ 12:25). Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ yeli anǝnɛyǝ mǝ Pɛtǝro (1 Pɛtǝro 5:13). Kǝto etieyǝ sa ŋ na ŋʊrʊ we, loh mǝ nuŋ yǝ rǝ nǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ sa lǝ kpǝŋ, otukpǝlo Pɛtǝro lǝ kpǝŋ mǝ eniyǝ we ŋwǝ Pɛtǝro ŋ ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ ru rǝ Yesu mǝ ŋ tíi enyipǝ wǝ. Marǝko la ŋʊrʊ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa la maŋ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ, wǝ́ ŋ na pɔrʊ ŋ na kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu ŋ ri Worokoyǝ le piyǝ wǝ (Marǝko 1:1). Rǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ we, la pɔrʊ Yesu la anǝnɛyǝ la kaŋ: Yesu la cá anyaatǝpǝ, lo koonu nyikpǝŋwǝ le keeriwǝ, le piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ rǝ enyipǝ lǝ mǝrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ na lɛ ŋ na kaŋ otuyǝ. Mǝŋ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ ke ri Worokoyǝ le piyǝ paape we, laa rɛɛrɩ mǝ na wɛ, duturǝ ɖi pǝlǝ kpǝ́ kǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ nya vɔrʊrǝ. Kǝnǝnɛkǝ sa Yesu ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ yeli paape wǝ́ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ sǝnǝ ŋwǝ pǝ cò, wǝ́ pǝ lɛ̀ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ kpìi enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ, wǝ́ pǝ tɔ̀ɔ na gbɛŋpɔrǝ. Wǝ kaamǝ kǝ ŋlǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ le ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu ŋ ri Lɔkuŋtǝyǝ we. Kǝto yǝ we ŋ na nya ŋ na lɔ ŋwǝ Yesu ŋ no nuŋ we, lǝ́ǝ fǝ yǝ we lo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ ŋwǝ kǝ ŋ lɛ ŋ pɔrʊ ŋwǝ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yǝ lóo koru ǝsǝpǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa la saŋ eni:</para>
  <para style="io">- Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we lo worokoŋtietɛŋrǝ 1:1-8</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu lo worokomɛŋwiiriwǝ 1:9-13</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu la anǝnɛyǝ rǝ Galileya 1:14–9:50</para>
  <para style="io">- Yerusalɛmǝ lo okookǝ 10:1-52</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu le ecituturuyǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ 11:1–15:47</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu la saanǝ rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ 16:1-8</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu la pɔrʊ na wɛ la kaŋ no otukarǝtǝpǝ 16:9-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ lo worokoŋtietɛŋrǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matewu 3:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowanɛsɩ 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Dieceeceerǝ we pǝ la ŋʊrʊ pǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ le Pi Yesu Kǝriso le kǝtiekǝ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Pǝ la ŋʊrʊ rǝ worokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝyǝ Ezaya la kǝfwɛɛkǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«A lǝŋ nyɩŋ, ŋ́ née kpii mǝ nyikpiiyǝ ŋ coŋ ŋ koonu lǝ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">kǝ ŋ ko toolu lá gʊŋrǝ.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Nyiyǝ rɛ ya lóo woolu rǝ nyɔŋkpaakǝtǝǝwǝ mǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Nǝ toolu Ǝtǝ Woroko la gʊŋrǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">nǝ kʊʊrʊ na akʊŋpiyǝ!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Kǝ́ wǝ yeli wǝǝ, wǝ́ Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rù rǝ nyɔŋkpaakǝtǝǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ mǝ ŋ tíi enyipǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ cɛkɛlɛ vɔrʊrǝ, nǝ kuŋ kǝ pǝ wiiri nǝ worokomɛŋwǝ, kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ nǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ nǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Yudeya la gaarǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le enyipǝ, mǝ Eyerusalɛmǝtǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ ko ŋ ko Yowanɛsɩ lǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ pǝlo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ wiiri pǝ lo worokomɛŋwǝ rǝ Yɔrǝdaŋ la kpanǝwǝ mǝrǝ.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Kpɔŋkɔyǝ lo ɖorǝ wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ pǝ yeli kǝkpakǝ we Yowanɛsɩ ŋ ke kpii wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ fwɛɛwǝ la apɔsɔyǝ ŋ pàrǝ rǝ kǝtɔŋkǝ. Okokoyǝ mǝ bwɛrǝ yǝ ke ri ne keeriwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Wǝ́ ŋ ko ŋ wòolu mǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ we ŋ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ ŋ teeri mǝ we, tǝǝlǝ mǝ rǝ. Ŋ́ naa kaamǝ kǝ́ ŋ́ náa pɛɛlɩ ŋ́ pɔrʊ na afʊkpayǝ ǝkǝŋtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ŋmǝ we, mɛŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ fǝ ŋ́ ne wiiri nǝ worokomɛŋwǝ. Ŋwǝ paa we, lǝh pǝ fǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ ŋ wiiri nǝ worokomɛŋwǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ le wiiri Yesu lo worokomɛŋwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matewu 3:13–4:11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Rǝ eciyǝ we mǝrǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ rù rǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Nazarɛtǝ wǝ kpii rǝ Galileya ŋ pǝlǝ. Wǝ́ Yowanɛsɩ ŋ wìiri no worokomɛŋwǝ rǝ Yɔrǝdaŋ la kpanǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Kǝ́ ŋ noh ru rǝ mɛŋwǝ we eni we, wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ yulaarǝ la taanǝ. Wǝ́ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ zʊ̀ rǝ ŋwǝ mǝŋ tookpaayǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Wǝ́ kpɛɛwǝ rɛ wǝ rù rǝ yulaarǝ wǝ pǝlǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ e ri mǝ piyǝ we ŋ́ náa taa kǝǝwǝ wǝ. Wǝ lo poŋ mǝ mǝ ŋ́ saa lǝ́ ŋ́ pɔrʊ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ vǝ̀ ŋwǝ golu nyɔŋkpaakǝtǝǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ kpìi rǝ nyɔŋkpaakǝtǝǝwǝ wǝcukpǝ tǝniǝ. Wǝ́ Satana ŋ tìe ŋwǝ ŋ yɩ̀rɩ. Ŋpǝ mǝ apɔɔkɛɛpǝ pǝ ke kpii, wǝ́ epicoŋpipǝ pǝ ke ŋ re ŋwǝ.<figure style="fig" alt="Le Saint Esprit est descendu sur Jésus lors de son baptême" file="DN00410b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="1:10">Wɛɛkenikenirǝ la sʊʊ rǝ Yesu kǝ́ pǝ le wiiri no worokomɛŋwǝ wǝ</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la tɛŋ Worokoŋtierǝ rǝ Galileya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ lɔ̀ Yowanɛsɩ pǝ tanǝ, eniyǝ we wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝlǝ Galileya. Wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ Worokoyǝ le Dieceeceerǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />«Eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ yǝ lo ro, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ wǝ lǝ kǝlǝ. Nǝ cɛkɛlɛ vɔrʊrǝ kǝ nǝ lɔ Dieceeceerǝ sa nǝ nuŋ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lo pwo asafʊcotǝpǝ rɛ eniǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matewu 4:18-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luka 5:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ màarǝ mǝ Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ ŋ ko ŋ ko, wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ asafʊcotǝpǝ rɛ eyi, Sɩmɔ mǝ na paanʊ Aŋdǝre, pǝ ya pǝ lóo co safʊyǝ rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pe siimǝ mǝ, kǝ ŋ́ fǝ nǝ ŋ́ yee epǝ we pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ mǝ enyipǝ rǝ mǝ kpǝŋ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ pǝ màa pǝla asafʊpǝ pǝ cò wǝ́ pǝ sìimǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ no ruu ŋ no ko tɩ we, wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ Zebede le pi Yakubu mǝ na paanʊ Yowanɛsɩ. Pǝ ke kpii rǝ pǝla gʊrɔrǝ pǝ ko ŋ toolu pǝla asafʊpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwò pǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ màa pǝlǝ tǝ Zebede mǝ anǝnɛyeetǝpǝ we rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we mǝrǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ sìimǝ Yesu pǝ ko ŋ ko.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá nyiyǝ rɛ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ ya lée kpii awɛɛlɩkǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi Kapɛrǝnawumǝ. Sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu Oyudatǝpǝ lo gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ, wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ otuyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Wǝ́ no otukaŋyǝ sa yǝ rili enyipǝ lo mumuŋ. Duturǝ ɖi laa kaŋ pǝ lo otuyǝ mǝŋ esekaŋtǝpǝ kǝtǝ, paa kanǝ yǝ mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Rǝ eniyǝ we tutu we, anyɩŋ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ kpii mǝ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ tini rǝ pǝlo gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ càa narǝwǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Yesu Nazarɛtǝtǝpiyǝ, kǝ́ wǝ́ a ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ rǝ lǝ? Ǝ lǝ pǝ ǝ pǝ nǝǝnǝ lǝ rǝ? Ŋ́ cii yǝ we e ri wǝ: Worokoyǝ le nyikenikeniyǝ wǝ́ e ri!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fanǝ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝŋ yiriri kǝ a tɛlɩ o ru rǝ nyiyǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Wǝ́ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ sa dìkili nyiyǝ sa mǝ okopiyǝ, wǝ́ jà narǝmumuŋwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ɖù rǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Wǝ́ wǝ rili enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lo mumuŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ lo tuwǝ wǝǝ? Kǝ́ lo otukaŋŋwɛŋyǝ yǝ kpii mǝ okopiyǝ ǝnǝ? Nyiyǝ lǝ yǝ láa faŋ mǝŋ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ, ǝ yǝ ŋ nuŋ no tutɛŋwǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Yesu la nyɩŋrǝ dò kpoo rǝ fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ rǝ Galileya la gaarǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá enyipǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matewu 8:14-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ no ru rǝ gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ we eni we, wǝ́ ŋpǝ mǝ Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ pǝ ko ŋ ko Sɩmɔ mǝ Aŋdǝre la nyarǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Anyɩŋ Sɩmɔ lo nutǝtieyǝ kpɛlɩ rǝ, láa rɛ naawǝ pʊrɩpʊrɩ. Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ pǝ tɛnɩ no tuwǝ pǝ tìi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ rùu ŋ kǝ̀lǝ mǝ tieyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tà ŋwǝ rǝ akaakǝ ŋ yìili. Wǝ́ ŋ kpàa. Wǝ́ Sɩmɔ lo nutǝtieyǝ we ŋ lɔ̀ pǝ lǝ kǝsǝǝkǝ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ɖiɔrǝ, kǝ́ cɔkɔŋyǝ ŋ na tɔɔ la kǝmaakǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ anyaatǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ, mǝ epǝ we pǝ kpii mǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tǝ̀nǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Wǝ́ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝpǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kù rǝ gukpǝ we ŋ ke kpii lo guŋpolurǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Wǝ́ ŋ cà anyaatǝpǝ wa, pǝ yà pǝ kǝ ŋ fǝrǝ anyarǝpiyǝ wǝrʊʊkpǝ kpookpoo wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ lɛ̀ ŋ pìri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ wa. Laa maa yǝ yǝ wɛɛlɩ, duturǝ ɖi yǝ ke cii yǝ we kǝtǝŋkǝ Yesu ŋ ri wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la pwɛyɩ rǝ Kapɛrǝnawumǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ɖokoŋpirǝ yuu, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yili, wǝ́ ŋ rù ŋ ko ŋ ko fɛɛwǝ enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ kǝlǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ rǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Wǝ́ Sɩmɔ ŋ kpìi ŋ ka ŋ taa ŋwǝ mǝŋ nǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Kǝ́ pǝ la ka nyɩŋ ŋwǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyi ri ŋ nyi ya láa taa lǝ́.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pǝ kǝ lo ko fɛɛpʊŋpwawǝ rɛ, rǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝpiyǝ sa rǝ gaarǝ sa, kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ ka tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ we rǝ afɛɛyǝ we ŋyǝ ŋkpɛ. Duturǝ ɖi ŋ wǝ kǝto wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ pǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Wǝ́ ŋ kolu Galileya la gaarǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ Dieceeceerǝ we ŋ tɛ̀lɩ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ lo okumwɛŋnyuŋyǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá nyarǝpimwɛɛrɩlǝtǝyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matewu 8:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Wǝ́ nyarǝpimwɛɛrɩlǝtǝyǝ rɛ ŋ pǝlǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ, wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ tɔ̀ɔ ŋ kʊnʊ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ kpìi na dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ wǝ ponu mǝ lǝ́ we, o lóo koru acá mǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Wǝ́ no tuwǝ wǝ cò Yesu la tǝlarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kòonu kǝnukǝ wǝ́ ŋ rùu ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ponu mǝ mǝ, kpaa!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Rǝ kǝyaakǝ we, wǝ́ na nyarǝpimwɛɛrɩrǝ we jɛ̀ rǝ ŋwǝ kɩɩkɩ, wǝ́ ŋ kpàa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na kaŋ ŋ ne tíi ŋwǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ pìri ŋwǝ kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yee yurǝ! Paa tɛŋ wǝ e tíi rɛ ŋ ri rɛ. Paa mǝ ko, kǝ fǝ lá wɛ a kaŋ toolutǝyǝ, kǝ o koonu otuyǝ we Mose ŋ na tɛŋ pǝ koonu, kǝ wǝ nya fɛɛ wǝ ri ɖaŋsieyǝ wǝ koonu pǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Paa kǝ́ ŋ na nya ŋ na pwɛyɩ ko we, wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ cà tuwǝ sa lo goŋkoŋrǝ ŋ ka ŋ tɛlɩ kpoo. Tuwǝ sa lo yurǝ kǝto Yesu lǝǝ tǝ ko ŋ koru oko tǝŋtǝǝwǝ rɛ kǝ pǝ nyɩŋ ŋwǝ. Paa ke ŋ tii rǝ akpaalǝyǝ, rǝ fɛɛwǝ enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ kǝlǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ ko ŋ ru rǝ fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ pǝ ŋ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá sǝŋyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matewu 9:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Rǝ ecipiyǝ rɛ la kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sìɛnɩ ŋ pǝlǝ Kapɛrǝnawumǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ nunu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ kpii rǝ nyarǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kù, anyɩŋ fɛɛwǝ wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ kpii, mǝŋ guŋpolurǝ ǝkǝŋtǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ Worokoŋtierǝ mǝŋ tìi pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ rɛ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ rù, pǝ re nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ otoŋyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ, enyi eniǝ pǝ ke re ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Paape kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ we kǝto we, pǝ loo koru efii mǝ ŋwǝ rǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ wǝ̀ǝrǝ akpanyaŋkǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we Yesu ŋ ke tini lo oŋuŋkǝ tutu. Wǝ́ pǝ sʊ̀ʊ mǝ sǝŋyǝ we mǝ nǝ vǝŋkǝrǝ we ŋ ka kpɛlɩ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na nyɩŋ enyipǝ sa la lɔnuŋrǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tìi nyiyǝ sa ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ otoŋyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ pi, pǝ lǝ fǝ ló oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ pǝ la cɛɛ lǝ́.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Esekaŋtǝpǝ rɛ pǝ ke tini rǝ fɛɛwǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ pǝla wɛ rǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nyiyǝ sa ŋ náa wɛɛlɩ ǝnǝ? Ya láa tɛŋ opusuŋtǝtuyǝ! Ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru ǝfǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ wǝ? We Worokoyǝ ceŋceŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nyɩnɩ wǝ ŋ cìi rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ kǝ́ esekaŋtǝpǝ we pǝ ya pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ pǝla wɛ rǝ mǝrǝ wǝǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ́ nǝ wɛ lo otuyǝ sa rǝ mǝrǝ ǝnǝ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Etieyǝ sa lǝ ɖǝ rǝ fǝŋ yɔlʊ deeri kǝ pǝ tɛŋ pǝ tíi sǝŋyǝ sa wǝ: “Pǝ lǝ fǝ ló oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ pǝ la cɛɛ lǝ́”, amaa: “Yi, fǝ lǝ́ vǝŋkǝrǝ kǝ a mǝ saŋ”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Wǝ ponu! Nǝ ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ.» Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi sǝŋyǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi lǝ́ yi, piri lǝ́ vǝŋkǝrǝ kǝ o mǝ ko nyarǝwǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Rǝ kǝyaakǝ we wǝ́ nyiyǝ sa ŋ yili, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ nǝ vǝŋkǝrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ rù ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ rǝ pǝlo kpǝlo le enimiyǝ. Wǝ́ tuwǝ sa wǝ rili enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lo mumuŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ kǝ Worokoyǝ pǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «La faa nyɩŋ tuwǝ sa kǝtǝŋkǝ lǝ tǝnǝ pwi!» <figure style="fig" alt="Malade descendant par le plafond" file="lb00305c.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass" ref="2:4">Pǝ lǝ wǝǝrǝ akpanyaŋkǝ pǝ la sʊʊ mǝ nyaatǝyǝ rɛ</figure><verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lo pwo Levi ŋ pe siimǝ ŋwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matewu 9:9-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ kolu Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ. Wǝ́ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ pǝlǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ pǝ lo otuyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ no ko ŋ nah tɛlɩ we, wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ Alǝfe le pi Levi, tini rǝ fɛɛlɔlaŋpooyǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Siimǝ mǝ.» Wǝ́ ŋ yili, wǝ́ ŋ sìimǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu ŋ tini ŋ ke ŋ ri rǝ Levi la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ alaŋpoolɔtǝpǝ wa mǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tini pǝ ke ŋ ri pǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ, kpiikǝ enyipǝ we pǝ ke ŋ siimǝ ŋwǝ pǝ ka naanǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Wǝ́ esekaŋtǝpǝ we pǝ ri Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ nyɩnɩ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ tini ŋ née ri mǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ mǝ alaŋpoolɔtǝpǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ŋ tini ŋ née ri mǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ alaŋpoolɔtǝpǝ mǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ ǝnǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nunu, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Anyaatǝpǝ pǝ lǝ pǝ́ wɛɛcátǝyǝ wǝ, ŋkǝ epǝ we pǝ kpaa purupuru wǝ. Ŋ́ nǝǝ pǝ ŋ́ po pwo enyikʊʊpǝ, oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ pǝ ŋ́ po pwo.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu le dierǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ nyuŋparǝkpǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matewu 9:14-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Jirɛɛrǝ Yowanɛsɩ lo otukarǝtǝpǝ mǝ Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ ka ŋ parǝ nyuŋkpǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ rɛ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yowanɛsɩ lo otukarǝtǝpǝ mǝ Afarisitǝpǝ lo otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ láa parǝ nyuŋkpǝ. Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ló otukarǝtǝpǝ paa pǝ lǝŋ parǝ nyuŋkpǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nyóo koru etíi tiɛŋwɛŋlǝtǝyǝ lǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ pǝ parǝ nyuŋkpǝ kǝ́ tiɛŋwɛŋlǝtǝyǝ ŋ tini ŋ kʊla mǝ pǝ wǝ? Kǝ́ tiɛŋwɛŋlǝtǝyǝ ŋ nya ŋ tini ŋ kʊla mǝ pǝ we, pǝ lǝŋ koru aparǝ nyuŋkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Paa eciyǝ yǝ lo furu, pǝ lǝh pǝ fǝ tiɛŋwɛŋlǝtǝyǝ pǝ cɛ rǝ pǝlǝ kpǝŋ. Jirǝ we we, pǝ láa parǝ nyuŋkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Rɛ lǝŋ fǝ nyaŋŋwɛŋrǝ lo tuwǝ ŋ ka tɛɛ kǝkpakuukuukǝ. Mǝŋ rɛ le yee wǝ we, nyaŋŋwɛŋrǝ we lo tuwǝ wǝ lée tiini kǝkpakuukuukǝ sa kǝ la. Fɛɛlarǝwǝ sa wǝ láa naanǝ wǝ teeri. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Rɛ lǝŋ kpii ǝfǝŋŋwɛŋpǝ rǝ fwɛɛwǝ le diikuukuurǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwɛɛwǝ le diirǝ ɖi rǝ diirǝ rɛ pǝ lǝ fǝ pereceeyǝ la fwɛɛwǝ pǝ le yee wǝ. Pǝ lée kpii mɛŋwǝ amaa ǝfǝŋpǝ rǝ diirǝ sa.</char></note>. Ǝfǝŋpǝ sa pǝ láa la fwɛɛwǝ le diirǝ we. Eniyǝ we mǝŋ ǝfǝŋpǝ we, mǝŋ diirǝ we yǝ lǝ pǝlǝ yǝ lo co. Kǝto ǝfǝŋŋwɛŋpǝ we, pǝ lée kpii rǝ fwɛɛwǝ le diiŋwɛŋrǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matewu 12:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Sabatǝyǝ le jirɛɛrǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sanǝ ŋ kolu ŋ ka ŋ tɛlɩ bǝleyǝ la wǝtɛɛkpǝ rɛ. Pǝ kpìi pǝ lóo ko wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ka ŋ pɔɔpʊ bǝleyǝ we la alaayǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Wǝ́ Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ ke ŋ tíi Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yɩrɩ tuwǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee mǝ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ re! Leh seyǝ lǝ kpǝlǝ wǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝto nǝ fǝǝ kǝ tuwǝ Davidǝ ŋ yeli kǝ́ ŋ ke kpii rǝ gbaraarǝ wǝ́ kǝtɛŋkǝ kǝ ka ŋ wʊ ŋpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ ke siimǝ ŋwǝ wǝ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Eniyǝ we Abiata ŋ ke ri toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we, wǝ́ Davidǝ ŋ fìi Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ wǝ́ ŋ wolu kpɔnɔyǝ we pǝ lo koonu Worokoyǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kòonu epǝ we pǝ ke siimǝ ŋwǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ. Paa gʊŋrǝ laa ka kpɛɛ kǝ rɛ ŋ wo kpɔnɔyǝ sa, we otoolutǝpǝ ko!» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokoyǝ le yee sabatǝyǝ lo koonu nyɩmaasɩyǝ. Lee yee nyɩmaasɩyǝ ŋ koonu sabatǝyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ŋ wǝ kǝto wǝ́ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋ ri Kulǝtǝyǝ ŋ koonu mǝŋ sabatǝyǝ wǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá nyiyǝ rɛ mǝ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matewu 12:9-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ sìɛnɩ ŋ kolu Oyudatǝpǝ lo gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ. Nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ kǝnukǝ ke kpii rǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Wǝ́ pǝ cò nimirǝ pǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ Yesu rɛyɩɩ kǝ pǝ nyɩŋ mǝŋ láa cá ŋwǝ mǝ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ wǝ. Pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ pǝ yee dierǝ mǝ ŋwǝ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi nyiyǝ sa ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ kǝnukǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yi a pa yaa rǝ kǝtiitiikǝ sa!» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi enyipǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ wǝ́ pǝ lo koonu gʊŋrǝ pǝ yee mǝ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ wǝ? Pǝ yee wǝceeceekpǝ amaa wǝrɔɔrɔɔkpǝ? Pǝ lɔ pǝ koonu nyiyǝ amaa pǝ maa ŋwǝ ŋ kpǝ́?» Wǝ́ pǝ rǝnǝ yiriri. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yɩ̀rɩ pǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ ku mǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊ mǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊ, duturǝ ɖi pǝlo yulɛnyɩrǝ gbìi na awɛɛlɩkǝ ŋpa. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi nyiyǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nwiɛnɩ ló kǝnukǝ.» Wǝ́ ŋ nwìɛnɩ kǝ. Wǝ́ no kǝnukǝ we kǝ sàanǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Kǝ́ pǝ la nya pǝ lo ru rǝ gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ we eni we, wǝ́ Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ kolu pǝ rili nyuŋkpǝ mǝ Erodɛsɩ la wǝcakukpǝ kǝ́ pǝ lée yee kǝ pǝ wʊ Yesu wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ lǝ pǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:25">Matewu 4:25</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:15-16">12:15-16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ rù pǝ kolu Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ. Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ rù rǝ Galileya wǝ sìimǝ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ rù rǝ Yudeya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Yerusalɛmǝ, Idume, Yɔrǝdaŋ la kǝtakǝ nɔ, Tiro mǝ Zidɔŋ la akaayǝ we, pǝ pǝlǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ nunu otuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ ŋ ya ŋ née yee wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ kpaka gʊrɔrǝ rɛ pǝ tǝnǝ ŋwǝ rǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we kǝto, kǝ enyipǝ pǝ paa nya fɛɛ pǝ pa mʊʊrʊ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Duturǝ ɖi cà enyipǝ ŋpa. Kǝto epǝ we kpǝlo pǝ kǝ lǝǝmǝ anyarǝpiyǝ we, pǝ ka ŋ nyɩɩnɩ awɛ rǝ, kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ ruu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Vǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ kpii mǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ pǝ la nyɩŋ Yesu ko, a pǝ ŋ sʊʊ pǝ kʊŋ ŋwǝ. Pǝ ŋ mǝ lɔ anarǝyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokoyǝ le piyǝ wǝ́ e ri!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Paape Yesu ke ŋ kpii seyǝ mǝ ŋ koonu yǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ yǝ paa tɛŋ nyiyǝ ŋwǝ ŋ ri yǝ tíi rɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la saa enyipǝ tǝ mǝ eyi pǝ ri ne enyikpiipǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matewu 10:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ rɛ̀ dutupirǝ, wǝ́ ŋ pwò epǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tùu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Wǝ́ ŋ pɔ̀rʊ tǝ mǝ enyi eyi rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ ŋ kʊ̀la mǝ na wɛ, kǝ mǝ ŋ kpii pǝ pǝ ŋ ko pǝ ŋ tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Wǝ́ ŋ kòonu pǝlo okopiyǝ kǝ pǝ ŋ piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìini pǝlǝ tǝ mǝ eyi. Ŋpǝ pǝ kaamǝ: Sɩmɔ yǝ we Yesu ŋ kpìi nyɩŋrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Pɛtǝro wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zebede le pi Yakubu, mǝ na paanʊ Yowanɛsɩ. Wǝ́ ŋ kpìi pǝla nyɩŋrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Bowanɛgɛsǝ, rǝlo duturǝ ɖi ǝrǝfáŋkǝ le epipǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Aŋdǝre, Filipo, Batelemi, Matewu, Toma, Alǝfe le pi Yakubu, Tade, Sɩmɔ yǝ we ŋ náa kɔŋ mǝ ŋ koonu nǝ gǝŋrǝ wǝ <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mǝ Yuda Isǝkario, yǝ we ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ sìiri Yesu wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝ Bɛlǝzebulǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matewu 12:22-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sìɛnɩ ŋ pǝlǝ nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ tǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kùu ŋpa, keeriwǝ sa ǝkǝŋtǝ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ loo koru wǝ le eri. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Kǝ́ no otuulupǝ pǝ lo nuŋ tuwǝ sa we, wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ pǝ fǝ ŋwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Le fii yurǝ rǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Wǝ́ oworokosekaŋtǝpǝ rɛ pǝ rù rǝ Yerusalɛmǝ pǝ pǝlǝ we, pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Bɛzebulǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ le piliyǝ kpii rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ. Wǝ́ ŋwǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ le piliyǝ sa ŋ no koonu no okopiyǝ ŋ ya ŋ née piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Wǝ́ ŋ pwò pǝ pǝ pǝlǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ tíi pǝ mǝ otutuyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Satana loh koru epiri Satana ŋ saŋ nɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Mǝŋ wǝpilirikpǝ rɛ le enyipǝ pǝ lǝ sǝpǝ wǝ́ pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ awɛ wǝǝ, wǝpilirikpǝ sa wǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ wǝ koru a tɔ yaa? <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ nyarǝwǝ rɛ le enyipǝ pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ awɛ we, nyarǝwǝ sa wǝ láa wɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ Satana le yi la tɛɛ rǝ na wɛ wǝ́ ŋ nǝ sǝpǝ we, we na nɛŋwǝ wǝ la lɛ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Rɛ lǝŋ koru e ke fii kopilǝtǝyǝ la nyarǝwǝ kǝ ŋ kʊlaŋ no otulǝmǝyǝ ŋ pwɛyɩ mǝŋ ŋkǝ la parǝ kopilǝtǝyǝ sa lǝ tǝnǝ kpɛŋ. Paa mǝŋ la parǝ ŋwǝ la lɛ we, lóo koru akʊlaŋ tu ri ŋ tu rǝ na nyarǝwǝ sa. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, pǝ lǝh pǝ fǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ lo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ le yee mǝ opusuŋtǝtuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la tɛŋ we, pǝ cɛɛ pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Paa yǝ we ŋ na wɛɛlɩ opusuŋtǝtuyǝ ŋ na tɛɛ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ we, pǝ lǝŋ pǝ fǝ wǝ pǝ cɛɛ ŋwǝ pwi. Duturǝ ɖi la tɔɔ bɔrǝ kǝkpakǝkpa rǝ no turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we ŋ ne yee kǝto.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu tìi pǝ lǝ wǝ ǝnǝ kpiikǝ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ rɛ gbii rǝ ŋwǝ kǝto».<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu le lee mǝ Yesu la apaanʊpǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matewu 12:46-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Rǝ fɛɛwǝ we wǝ́ Yesu le lee mǝ Yesu la apaanʊpǝ mǝ na apaatɛpǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wǝŋʊrʊrɛɛkpǝ wǝ lee kpii «na apaatɛpǝ».</char></note> pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ rù. Wǝ́ pǝ yàa rǝ koruwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ kpìi nyiyǝ ŋ ko pwo ŋwǝ ŋ co pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Anyɩŋ nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ le tii wǝ lo co wǝ le siri ŋwǝ wǝ lo po ku. Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A lǝŋ nyɩŋ, lé lee mǝ lá paanʊ peni pǝ yaa rǝ koruwǝ ǝnǝ. Pǝ ya pǝ láa taa lǝ́.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝpǝ rǝ fǝŋ pǝ ri mǝ lee mǝ mǝ apaanʊpǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Wǝ́ ŋ yɩ̀rɩ enyipǝ we pǝ le tii pǝ lo co pǝ le siri ŋwǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kù. Wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ, mǝ lee mǝ mǝ apaanʊpǝ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Yǝ we ŋ ya ŋ née yee Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ we, ŋwǝ yǝ we ŋ ri mǝ paanʊyǝ, mǝ paatɛyǝ mǝ mǝ leeyǝ wǝ».<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca duturǝ lo ru rǝ tɛɛtɛɛkpɛŋtǝyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tìe otukaŋyǝ rǝ Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ ke. Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ kù rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ, wǝ kǝto ŋ kolu ŋ fìi gʊrɔrǝ rɛ ga tɛɛ rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we ŋ tini wǝǝ. Nyikpǝŋwǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ ka yaa rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kanǝ pǝ lo otuyǝ wa ŋ sanǝ rǝ otutucayǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ tíi pǝ rǝ no otukaŋyǝ we mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Nǝ nuŋ re! Tɛɛtɛɛkpɛŋtǝyǝ rɛ kolu ŋ ka caŋ otuyǝ rǝ na atɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Wǝ́ kǝ́ ŋ ya ŋ nóo co otuyǝ we we, wǝ́ epirɛɛyǝ yǝ tɔ̀ɔlʊ rǝ kʊŋlɛɛrɩwǝ yǝ kolu. Wǝ́ ofuripǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ sìeni yǝ pǝ pɔ̀ɔlʊ kɩɩkɩ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Wǝ́ epirɛɛyǝ yǝ tɔ̀ɔlʊ rǝ zwiɛŋrǝ la fɛɛwǝ kǝnyaanǝkǝ kǝ laa ka naanǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa. Wǝ́ epiyǝ sa yǝ wìili kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ kpiikǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ we wǝ loo ko suunu kǝto. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kǝ́ cɔkɔŋyǝ ŋ no kuu we, wǝ́ ŋ yeli yǝ. Wǝ́ yǝ kpǝ̀, kpiikǝ yǝ lǝǝ lǝmǝ okuruŋkuyǝ kǝ yǝ naanǝ kǝto. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Wǝ́ epirɛɛyǝ yǝ tɔ̀ɔlʊ rǝ owuyǝ la fɛɛwǝ. Kǝ́ owuyǝ we yǝ le yi we, wǝ́ yǝ lɔ̀ epiyǝ we yǝ le wiili wǝ, kǝto yǝ laa nyɩŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Wǝ́ epirɛɛyǝ yǝ tɔ̀ɔlʊ rǝ kǝtǝǝceeceewǝ. Wǝ́ yǝ wìili, wǝ́ yǝ nàanǝ, wǝ́ yǝ nyɩnɩ ǝtǝnǝyǝ, arɛɛyǝ tǝta, arɛɛyǝ tǝkʊraŋ, arɛɛyǝ tuuru.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yìili ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ we ŋ lǝǝmǝ otukoŋyǝ ŋ nóo nuŋ tuwǝ we, ŋ nuŋ oo!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwǝ kǝto Yesu ŋ náa wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ ca rǝ otutuyǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matewu 13:10-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Kǝ́ wǝ lo ko tuuru Yesu ceŋceŋ we, wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ ke ŋ sìimǝ ŋwǝ pǝ ŋ tɛlɩ fǝ kʊla mǝ enyikpiipǝ we tǝ mǝ eyipǝ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ̀ ne etieyǝ ru rǝ otutuyǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋnǝ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ na pɔrʊ ne wǝpilirikpǝ lo tuŋwaawǝ ŋ na kaŋ wǝ. Paa okorutǝpǝ we, pǝ loh mǝ nuŋ tu ri ŋ tu saŋ rǝ otutucayǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Mǝŋkǝsa we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">pǝ lóo koru a mǝ yɩrɩ, paape pǝ lǝŋ nyɩŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">wǝ́ pǝ lóo koru o mǝ nuŋ tuwǝ mǝŋkǝsa paape pǝ lǝŋ nuŋ wǝlo duturǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Mǝŋ ŋkǝ kaa wǝǝ we, pǝ lah pa siɛrɩ vɔrʊrǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ pǝ fǝ ŋ cɛɛ pǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nyoo nuŋ duturǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ? We nǝ nyée yee nɛ kǝ nǝ po koru otutuyǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lǝ mǝrǝ lo onuŋ? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Tɛɛtɛɛkpɛŋtǝyǝ we we, ya lóo co Worokoyǝ le dierǝ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Kʊŋlɛɛrɩwǝ we epiyǝ we yǝ la tɔɔlʊ wǝ kaamǝ enyipǝ we pǝ lóo nuŋ Worokoŋtierǝ, kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ Satana ŋ pa ta dierǝ we pǝ la rʊ rǝ pǝ ŋ pɔrʊ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Kaa wǝǝ, epǝ we pǝ la lɔ oturʊʊyǝ we rǝ zwiɛŋrǝ lǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ we, pǝ kaamǝ epǝ we vǝ́ pǝ lo nuŋ dierǝ sa we, pǝ ŋ lɔ rǝ kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ mǝ faawǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Paa pǝ lǝŋ maa dierǝ sa ɖu okuruŋkuyǝ rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ. Pǝ láa lɔ pǝ ŋ nuŋ rǝ enipiyǝ rɛ lǝ mǝrǝ ko. Vǝ́ acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ yǝ lo tuu pǝ, amaa pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ pǝ rǝ ŋrǝ Worokoŋtierǝ kǝto we, kalaŋ, oturu pǝ la nyarǝ lɔnuŋrǝ pǝ lo co. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Arɛɛpǝ pǝ la lɔ oturʊʊyǝ we rǝ owuyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ. Ŋpǝ pǝ kaamǝ epǝ we pǝ lo nuŋ Worokoŋtierǝ we <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />paape ǝrǝkǝ sa lo oyupuyǝ, otulǝmǝyǝ le kǝnyitǝǝnǝkǝ mǝ otupʊŋpwayǝ le nimimwɛɛrɩwǝ yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ yǝ ŋ lɔ kǝtiikǝ rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ, oturu yǝ la lɔ Worokoŋtierǝ we. Dierǝ sa lǝŋ tɛɛ mǝ ǝtǝnǝyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Arɛɛpǝ pǝ la lɔ oturʊʊyǝ we rǝ kǝtǝǝceeceewǝ. Ŋpǝ pǝ kaamǝ epǝ we pǝ lóo nuŋ Worokoŋtierǝ, pǝ ŋ lɔ rǝ, pǝ ŋ nyɩŋ ǝtǝnǝyǝ: Arɛɛpǝ tǝta, arɛɛpǝ tǝkʊraŋ, arɛɛpǝ tuuru.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca duturǝ lo ru rǝ kaŋrewǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matewu 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Vǝ́ pǝ lo too kaŋrewǝ wǝǝ, ǝ pǝ ŋ fǝ zomurǝ pǝ punu wǝ? Amaa ǝ pǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ pǝ ke kpii rǝ gacarǝ lǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ? Ŋkǝ pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ wǝ pǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ tutɛɛkaŋrewǝ rǝ? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Duturǝ ɖi tu ri ŋ tu wǝ la ŋwaa we, pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ pǝ ŋ pɔrʊ wǝ pǝ ŋ fɛlɩ. Wǝ́ tuŋwaawǝ rɛ wǝ laa lɛ wǝ kpii kǝ oturu wǝ lǝŋ po ru wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mǝŋ rɛ lǝǝmǝ otukoŋyǝ ŋ nóo nuŋ we, kǝ ŋ nuŋ!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ dierǝ we nǝ ya nǝ nyóo nuŋ sɩsiɛrɩ! Duturǝ ɖi tuwǝ we nǝ nyǝ́ǝ fǝ nǝ nyǝ ŋ kaa nǝ nyǝ ŋ koonu enyipǝ we, ŋ wǝ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝh pǝ fǝ ŋ kaa ŋ koonu nǝ, kǝ ŋ co nǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Duturǝ ɖi yǝ we ŋ lǝǝmǝ tuwǝ we, pǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ pǝ ŋ koonu ŋwǝ pǝ kʊla. Paa yǝ we ŋ nǝǝ lǝmǝ tǝrɛ we, pǝ láa lɔ mǝŋ pipiwǝ we wǝ kpɛɛlɩ ŋwǝ wǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca duturǝ lo ru rǝ durʊʊpirǝ rɛ le wii ŋrǝŋrǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matewu 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ wǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ na rʊ otuyǝ rǝ na atɛɛkǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Vǝ́ ǝrǝkǝ kǝ la cɩɩ ŋ kpɛɛ, vǝ́ kǝ la kaalǝ ŋ yi. Rǝ eniyǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ we, oturʊʊyǝ we yǝ le wiili, yǝ ya yǝ láa naanǝ, lee ci kǝ́ wǝ lée yee wǝ ŋ fǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kǝtǝǝwǝ wǝ ŋ wǝ wǝ lée wii ewetuyǝ kpɛŋ, kǝmaamaa we, yǝ ŋ nyɩŋ, e ci oturu yǝ le fii epiyǝ nyɩrɩrɩ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Vǝ́ yǝ lo kuru yǝ la lɛ we, tɛɛtɛɛkpɛŋtǝyǝ ŋ fǝ na kǝpanǝkǝ ŋ ke ce. Duturǝ ɖi eniŋceyǝ yǝ lo ro.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca duturǝ lo ru rǝ durʊʊŋɩnɩŋɩnɩpirǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matewu 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ lo tu wǝ́ yǝ lǝh fǝ la ca mǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ, amaa yǝ lah wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ kpǝ saŋ rǝ dutucarǝ rǝ fǝŋ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ wǝ lo ru durʊʊŋɩnɩŋɩnɩpirǝ rɛ. Vǝ́ pǝ la rʊʊ rǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ we, ŋrǝ ɖi oturʊʊpiyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ rǝ ǝrǝkǝ le bipipipirǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Paa vǝ́ pǝ la rʊʊ rǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ pǝ la lɛ la kǝmaa we, oturu gbii láa rɛ, lǝ ŋ pa naanǝ deeri eciituturuyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ rǝ atɛɛkǝ we. Wǝ lóo ru alaŋmumuŋyǝ rɛ ofuripǝ pǝ lóo koru oco pǝlo okuyǝ rǝ yǝle sisiwǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Saŋ rǝ otutuyǝ wa mǝŋ ǝyǝ ǝnǝ kǝtǝŋkǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kǝ ŋ fǝ mǝ ŋ tɛŋ Worokoŋtierǝ we mǝ ŋ tíi enyipǝ, kǝ́ pǝ láa nya pǝ nuŋ rǝlo duturǝ rǝ ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Laa ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ tíi pǝ kǝ oturu laa wɛɛlɩ ŋ saŋ rǝ otutuyǝ. Paa vǝ́ ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ ko pǝ tini we, ŋ pɔrʊ tu ri ŋ tu lo duturǝ ŋ tíi pǝ.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la taarǝ kǝkpǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matewu 8:23-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ŋrǝ jirǝ we la ɖiɔrǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pǝ kǝ la ta lo ko kǝtakǝ nɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Wǝ́ pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ rǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we lǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ mǝ gʊrɔrǝ we ŋ ke kpii pǝ ko ŋ ko, anyɩŋ akʊrɔrɛɛyǝ yǝ tɛɛmǝ ŋwǝ yǝ lóo ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Wǝ́ kǝkpǝmumuŋkǝ rɛ kǝ pǝlǝ kǝ ko ŋ fuŋ. Wǝ́ mɛŋwǝ wǝ ke ŋ yi wǝ ŋ ca rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we. Anyɩŋ mɛŋwǝ wǝ la marǝ wǝ lǝh lǝ gʊrɔrǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu ŋwǝ paa yà ka ŋ kpɛɛ rǝ gʊrɔrǝ sa la kǝmaakǝ, la tɛɛ yurǝ rǝ buturǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ sàanǝ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, yǝ lǝh kpǝ́, kǝto wǝ lǝǝ fǝ lǝ́ fɛɛwǝ rɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Kǝ́ ŋ ne yi we, wǝ́ ŋ fanǝ ǝrǝfuŋkǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tìi mɛŋwǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝŋ yiriri! Yee rɛyɩɩ!» Wǝ́ kǝkpǝkǝ we kǝ tàarǝ, wǝ́ fɛɛwǝ we wǝ rǝnǝ yiriri. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyóo suu vurǝ ǝnǝ? Nǝ faa lɔ nǝ nuŋ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Wǝ́ pǝ fìi vumumuŋrǝ rɛ, wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝlǝ ŋ kaamǝ nyiyǝ sa kǝtǝŋkǝ mǝŋ ǝrǝfuŋkǝ mǝŋ mɛŋwǝ, yǝ lóo nuŋ no tutɛŋwǝ ǝnǝ?» <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus calme la tempête" file="DN00435b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="4:39">Yesu la taarǝ kǝkpǝkǝ</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá yufiitǝyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matewu 8:28-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ tà puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝtakǝ nɔ rǝ Ekerasetǝpǝ lǝ gǝŋrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na nya ŋ no ru rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we eni we, wǝ́ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ kpii mǝ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ, ŋ rù rǝ ofuŋtɔŋyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ ŋ po ku mǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ofuŋtɔŋyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ ke ri ne kǝtiikǝ. Wǝ́ rɛ lǝǝ tǝ ko ŋ koru aparǝ ŋwǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri pǝ lǝ fǝ akpɛtɛɛyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Duturǝ ɖi enirɛɛyǝ pǝ ka ŋ parǝ no wǝnukpǝ mǝ akpɛtɛɛyǝ ǝ pǝ ŋ kpii no gborǝ rǝ akparǝyǝ. Paape kǝ ŋ sǝǝrǝ akpɛtɛɛyǝ we ŋ lɛ ŋ poolu gborǝ we. Wǝ́ kopilǝtǝyǝ rɛ lee ke kpii ŋ noh koru ŋwǝ le esi tǝnǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Eni ri ŋ ni, mǝŋ dumu mǝŋ jɔkɔŋ anyɩŋ kpii rǝ fɛɛŋwaanyipǝ mǝ otutupiyǝ láa tɛlɩ. Ŋ mǝ ca anarǝyǝ, ŋ fǝ oruyǝ mǝ ŋ sieni na wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Kǝ́ ŋ na nyɩŋ Yesu ŋ na maŋ we, wǝ́ ŋ sùu ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kʊnʊ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Wǝ́ ŋ cà narǝwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yesu, Worokoyǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ oŋuŋkǝ le Piyǝ, kǝ́ wǝ kpii rǝ ŋlǝ mǝ lǝ́ lǝ mǝrǝ? Ŋ́ nǝ fǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ́ ne kpii lǝ́ dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ, poo kuŋ kǝ ŋ́ nyɩŋ ariaayǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Duturǝ ɖi Yesu tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ, ru rǝ nyiyǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Lá nyɩŋrǝ ɖi nɛ?» Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋmǝ ŋ́ ri “Kpǝŋwǝ”, kpiikǝ la naanǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ kpii Yesu la dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ ŋpaŋpa ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ pee piri pǝ ŋ ru rǝ gǝŋrǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Anyɩŋ fáŋkpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ ka ya wǝ ke ŋ ri rǝ dutupirǝ la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Wǝ́ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ we yǝ kpìi Yesu la dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Piri lǝ e kpii rǝ afáŋpǝ sa, kǝ le ke fii rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kòonu yǝ la gʊŋrǝ. Wǝ́ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ we yǝ rù rǝ nyiyǝ sa yǝ kolu yǝ fìi rǝ afáŋpǝ we. Wǝ́ fáŋkpǝŋwǝ sa wǝ rù rǝ kǝlaŋlaŋkǝ we wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ tɔ̀ɔ rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we. Afáŋpǝ we pǝ lée fii lafawǝ yi. Wǝ́ pǝ ŋunu mɛŋwǝ pǝ kpǝ̀ rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we mǝrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wǝ́ afáŋrǝŋtǝpǝ we pǝ sùu pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ pǝ kolu pǝ tɛnɩ tuwǝ sa rǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we mǝ epwiitǝŋyǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ rù pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ pǝ pa yɩrɩ tuwǝ we wǝ lǝ pǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo po tuu Yesu we, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ nyiyǝ we ŋ ke kpii mǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ lǝ kpǝŋwǝ le kpii wǝkpakpǝ tini, enimiyǝ yǝ le celi ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ wǝ cò pǝ lo vurǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ nyɩnɩ tuwǝ we wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ tùu nyiyǝ we ŋ ke kpii mǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ, mǝ tuwǝ we wǝ yeli afáŋpǝ we we, pǝ fǝ̀ yǝ pǝ pɔ̀ pǝla amayǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ ke ŋ kpii Yesu la dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ ŋ pwɛyɩ rǝ pǝla gaarǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Eniyǝ we Yesu ŋ neh fii gʊrɔrǝ we, wǝ́ nyiyǝ we ŋ ke kpii mǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ ya ŋ ka ŋ tɔɔ mǝ ŋ kpɛɛ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ née siimǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu loo kuŋ na gʊŋrǝ, paa wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ ko nyarǝwǝ, lé enyipǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, kǝ ǝ kǝ fǝ tu ri ŋ tu Ǝtǝ Woroko ŋ ne yee ŋ no koonu lǝ́, mǝ kǝ́ ŋ ne yee lǝ́ wǝceeceekpǝ we, a pɔ pǝla amayǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Wǝ́ nyiyǝ sa ŋ ko ŋ ko, wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ kpìi ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ otuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ Ǝtǝ Woroko ŋ ne yee ŋ no koonu ŋwǝ mǝ ŋ tɛlɩ rǝ Dekapolǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapolǝ lo duturǝ ɖi: Tǝŋtǝǝtǝwǝ we. Wǝ ri rǝ gaarǝ rɛ gbii golu rǝ Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ rǝ kǝcɔkɔŋpoŋkǝ.</char></note> la gaarǝ we. Wǝ́ tuwǝ sa wǝ rili nyi ri ŋ nyi lo mumuŋ.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá tieyǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ŋ na saanǝ Yayiro la gɔrʊpirǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matewu 9:18-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na siɛnɩ ŋ na pa ta kǝtakǝ sa mǝ gʊrɔrǝ we, wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ kù rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. Ka yàa rǝ puŋkɔwǝ we la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Wǝ́ Oyudatǝpǝ lo gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ lo mumuŋyǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Yayiro ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ ko ŋ ru. Kǝ́ ŋ na nyɩŋ Yesu we, wǝ́ ŋ sʊ̀ʊ ŋ kʊnʊ rǝ na wǝkʊŋkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ nyɩɩ mǝ ŋ kpii na dɔɔkpɛɛrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ gɔrʊpirǝ lǝh kpǝ́, pǝ a pa tɛɛ na akaakǝ kǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ kpaa, kǝ ŋ tii vɔrʊrǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yili ŋ sìimǝ ŋwǝ ŋ ko ŋ ko. Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ sìimǝ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ nyɩɩnɩ ŋwǝ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Anyɩŋ tieyǝ rɛ ŋ ka ŋ sʊʊ ŋpǝrayǝ cɛŋwǝ tǝ mǝ yi ka yaa rǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Cʊ̀ʊrʊ rǝ awɛɛcatǝpǝ wa la wǝkaakpǝ ŋpa, wǝ́ ŋ lɛ̀ no otulǝmǝyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ loo co ga! Paa wǝ tǝ wǝ kǝ ŋ pǝlǝ wǝ ŋ kʊla rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Enyipǝ pǝ ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ pǝ ŋ ru rǝ Yesu, wǝ́ ŋ nunu. Wǝ́ ŋ rù rǝ kǝmaakǝ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ rǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rùu Yesu la kǝkpakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Duturǝ ɖi ke ŋ tíi na wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ ŋ́ na nya ŋ́ no ruu na kǝkpakǝ rǝ ǝkǝŋtǝ we, ŋ́ náa kpaa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Rǝ kǝyaakǝ we, wǝ́ na ŋpǝrayǝ we ŋ ka ŋ sʊʊ ŋwǝ ŋ sǝnǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ wǝ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ na kpaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nyɩnɩ wǝ ŋ cìi ǝkǝnǝŋ okopiyǝ rɛ yǝ lo ru rǝ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ sìɛrɩ rǝ kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ we mǝrǝ wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝlǝ ŋ no ruu mǝ kǝkpakǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ke ŋ tíi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A la nyɩŋ kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ sa kǝ ya kǝ láa nyɩɩnɩ lǝ́ wǝ́ ǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Ǝlǝ ŋ no ruu mǝ wǝ?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Paape wǝ́ ŋ yɩ̀rɩ ŋ sìri ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kù kǝ ŋ nyɩŋ yǝ we ŋ yeli tuwǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Wǝ́ vurǝ vìi tieyǝ sa, láa ca kpakpa duturǝ ɖi ke cii tuwǝ wǝ lǝ pǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kʊnʊ rǝ Yesu la kǝnyɩŋkǝ wǝ́ ŋ tìi na anʊkɔrǝyǝ kɩɩkɩ. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ kɔrʊ, lá lɔnuŋrǝ la pɔrʊ lǝ́, mǝ ko rǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ. Kpaa mǝ la nyarǝpirǝ sa.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Eniyǝ we Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ ya ŋ náa wɛɛlɩ we, wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ rù rǝ gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ lo mumuŋyǝ sa la nyarǝwǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Lá gɔrʊpirǝ we lǝ kpǝ́, ǝ lǝh tǝ e mǝŋ kpii Tukaŋtǝyǝ la awɛɛlɩkǝ e yee kǝ́?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Paape Yesu lǝǝ fǝ etieyǝ we ŋ yee tǝrɛ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ lo mumuŋyǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Poo suu vurǝ, lɔ o nuŋ rǝ ko.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Laa maa rɛ ŋ tɛɛmǝ ŋwǝ, we Pɛtǝro, Yakubu mǝ Yakubu la paanʊ Yowanɛsɩ ko. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ sa lo mumuŋyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nyɩnɩ enyipǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ woyowoyo, enyipǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée wee pǝ ŋ ca anarǝyǝ ŋpaŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Kǝ́ ŋ ne fii nyarǝwǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa ca anarǝmumuŋyǝ sa wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée wee ǝnǝ? Piyǝ sa lǝǝ kpǝ́, ya láa kpɛɛ eniŋrieyǝ rǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ mɔɔnʊ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pɔ̀rʊ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ rù, wǝ́ ŋpǝ mǝ piyǝ we lǝ tǝyǝ mǝ ne leeyǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ epǝ we pǝ ke sìimǝ ŋwǝ pǝ fìi fɛɛwǝ we piyǝ we ŋ ka kpɛlɩ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Wǝ́ ŋ tà piyǝ we la akaakǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Talita kumi!» Wǝlo duturǝ ɖi: «Gɔrʊpirǝ, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi lǝ́, saanǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ gɔrʊpirǝ we yili, wǝ́ ya ga ŋ saŋ. Kǝ lǝǝmǝ cɛŋwǝ tǝ mǝ yi. Wǝ́ wǝ rili pǝlo mumuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpìi seyǝ ŋ kòonu pǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ pǝ poo kuŋ kǝ rɛ ŋ ci wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ pǝ koonu gɔrʊpirǝ we la tǝrɛ ɖi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ Yesu rǝ Nazarɛtǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:54-58">Matewu 13:54-58</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ no ru rǝ fɛɛwǝ we we, wǝ́ ŋ ko ŋ ko nǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ. Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ sìimǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Kǝ́ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ lo ro we, wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ otuyǝ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ lo gumwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ. Wǝ́ no otukaŋyǝ we yǝ rili kǝkpǝŋmumuŋkǝ we kǝ yà kǝ ko ŋ nuŋ ŋwǝ lo mumuŋ, wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «La nya etieyǝ sa lo ru rǝ fǝŋ? Wǝ́ ǝlǝ ŋ no koonu no otuciyǝ mǝ okopiyǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ya ŋ née yee otucovurǝ ǝnǝ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Kǝto ŋkǝ Marɩya le pi kusiitǝyǝ we ǝyǝǝ? Ŋkǝ Yakubu, Yose, Yuda mǝ Sɩmɔ le mǝteeyǝ ŋ lǝǝwe? Mǝŋkǝ na apaatɛpǝ pǝ kpii rǝ lǝh kpǝŋ rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa?» Wǝ kǝto pǝ loo koru alɔ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Enyipǝ pǝ lǝ́ǝ kǝ worokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝyǝ rǝ fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ, we tɛŋ nǝ gǝŋrǝ mǝ no otuulupǝ mǝ na nyarǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ko wǝ́ pǝ lǝŋ kǝ ŋwǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kǝto Yesu loo koru eyee tucovurǝ rɛ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we, paa anyaatǝpǝ rɛ ko wǝ́ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ wǝkaakpǝ wǝ́ pǝ kpàa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Wǝ́ wǝ rili Yesu lo mumuŋ mǝ kǝ́ nǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝpǝ pǝ laa lɔ pǝ nuŋ wǝ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu le kpii ne enyikpiipǝ we tǝ mǝ eyipǝ la gʊŋrǝ</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matewu 10:5-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Rǝ wǝla kǝmaakǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sìri ŋ kolu ǝtǝŋtǝǝpiyǝ we yǝ kpii rǝ gaarǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ otuyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Wǝ́ ŋ pwò ne enyikpiipǝ we tǝ mǝ eyipǝ ŋ pǝlǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ kpii pǝ mǝ ŋ maŋ eyi eyi. Wǝ́ ŋ kòonu pǝ lo okopiyǝ rǝ awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Wǝ́ ŋ kpìi seyǝ ŋ kòonu pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pee re tǝrɛ nǝ saŋ gʊŋrǝ, we ciisaŋwǝ ko. Nǝ pee re keeriwǝ rɛ amaa akpoyǝ rɛ, amaa sɩkayǝ rɛ rǝ na apɔsɔyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Nǝ kpii rǝ afʊkpapayɩpayɩyǝ, nǝ pee re wǝkpakpǝ wǝyi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ nǝ nyée ke fii fɛɛwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ nǝ nyáa ka sʊʊrʊ rǝ nyarǝwǝ rɛ we, nǝ tii rǝ we ko ro eniyǝ we nǝ nyáa pwɛyɩ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mǝŋ nǝ nye fii fɛɛwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ pǝ laa lɔ nǝ kǝsǝǝkǝ, wǝ́ pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ pǝ loo nuŋ nǝ dierǝ we, nǝ tɛrɩ naŋrǝ we dɛɛ rǝ na akparǝyǝ nǝ tǝnǝ, kǝ nǝ pwɛyɩ rǝ we. O lóo turu wǝ leh ri ɖaŋsieyǝ wǝ tɛɛ rǝ pǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Wǝ́ pǝ ko ŋ ko, pǝ kolu pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ Worokoŋtierǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ siɛrɩ vɔrʊrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Pǝ pìri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ wa. Wǝ́ pǝ nunu anyaatǝpǝ wa la apɔŋpǝ pǝ cà pǝ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piliyǝ Erodɛsɩ lo nuŋ pǝ la tɛŋ Yesu le dierǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matewu 14:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Yesu rù nyɩŋrǝ, wǝ́ piliyǝ Erodɛsɩ ŋ nunu wǝ. Enyipǝ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we la saanǝ lo ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ! Wǝ kǝto ŋ na nya okopiyǝ ŋ ya ŋ née yee otucovurǝ wǝǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Wǝ́ arɛɛpǝ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Eliya ŋ lǝǝwe». Apʊŋpwapǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝyǝ ŋ lǝǝwe tǝ a mǝ yɩrɩ akakatǝworokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ we la rɛ kǝtǝ». <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kǝ́ Erodɛsɩ ŋ no nuŋ etieyǝ sa we, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yowanɛsɩ, yǝ ǝnǝ ŋ́ kòonu pǝ sǝ̀ yurǝ we, ŋwǝ ŋ na saanǝ ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝnǝ».<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we lǝ ǝkpǝ́kǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-12">Matewu 14:3-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luka 3:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, Erodɛsɩ ŋ kòonu pǝ lɔ̀ Yowanɛsɩ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ pàrǝ ŋwǝ mǝ akpɛtɛɛyǝ wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ kolu pǝ tanǝ rǝ gukpɛɛkpǝ, rǝ Erodia lo yurǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Erodɛsɩ fǝ̀ ŋwǝŋwǝ ne mǝteeyǝ Filipo le tie Erodia lɔ̀. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Wǝ́ Yowanɛsɩ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ Erodɛsɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Gʊŋrǝ lee kpii kǝ ǝ fǝ lé mǝteeyǝ le tieyǝ a lɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Dierǝ sa kǝto wǝ́ Erodia ŋ kpǝ̀lǝ Yowanɛsɩ lǝ kǝǝwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ ŋ wʊ ŋwǝ paape loo koru, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kpiikǝ Erodɛsɩ ko ŋ suu Yowanɛsɩ lo vurǝ kǝto. Ke cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yowanɛsɩ ri nyikʊʊyǝ mǝ nyikenikeniyǝ, kǝto kǝ ŋ kǝrǝŋ ŋwǝ. Vǝ́ Erodɛsɩ ya lóo nuŋ Yowanɛsɩ le etietɛŋyǝ we, wǝ lée kpii na awɛɛlɩkǝ ŋpa, paape wǝ ka ŋ ca na kpɛɛ mǝ ŋ nuŋ yǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Jirɛɛrǝ we, wǝ́ Erodɛsɩ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ ke ŋ ri ne jimǝrǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ cà keerimumuŋwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ŋ pwòolu na acaamɩpǝ, no otuusiitǝpǝ lo omumuŋpǝ, mǝ Galileya lo omumuŋpǝ pǝ pe ri. Jirǝ we wǝ́ Erodia ŋ nya gʊŋrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Wǝ́ ŋwǝ Erodia la gɔrʊpirǝ bǝlǝ ya go ŋ yo. Wǝ́ wǝ cà Erodɛsɩ mǝ enyipǝ we ŋ pwòolu la kpɛɛ. Wǝ́ piliyǝ ŋ tìi gɔrʊpirǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tuwǝ we wǝ ponu mǝ lǝ́ we, pǝ́ mǝ, ŋ́ nóo koonu lǝ́ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Wǝ́ ŋ tù ŋ tìi gɔrʊpirǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tu ri ŋ tu a láa nya ǝ pǝ́ mǝ ko we, ŋ́ nóo koonu lǝ́ wǝ. Wǝ ke ce wǝ ri mǝ gǝŋrǝ sa la kǝnyalǝkǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Wǝ́ gɔrʊpirǝ sa ɖù golu bǝ̀ rǝle le ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ pǝ́ kǝ́ lo tu?» Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ lo yurǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Wǝ́ ŋ kpǝ̀lǝŋ kalaŋ ŋ kolu ŋ tùu piliyǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ a tɛɛ Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we lo yurǝ rǝ kpɛtɛlɛyǝ o po koonu mǝ rǝkǝsa rǝkǝsa.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Wǝ́ tuwǝ sa wǝ fǝ̀rǝ piliyǝ ŋpa, paape kǝ́ ŋ tù ŋ tǝ̀nǝ rǝ enyipǝ we ŋ pwòolu le enimiyǝ kǝto we, loo tu turuwǝ ŋ sǝ́ŋ wǝ ŋ koonu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ piliyǝ ŋ kpii nǝ rǝŋtǝyǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ŋ ke re Yowanɛsɩ lo yurǝ ŋ po koonu ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ rǝŋtǝyǝ sa ŋ kolu ŋ sǝ̀ Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we lo yurǝ rǝ gukpɛɛkpǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ yurǝ we ŋ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ kpɛtɛlɛyǝ ŋ pǝlǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ rǝ ŋ kòonu gɔrʊpirǝ sa. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ rǝ ŋ kolu ŋ kòonu ne lee. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Kǝ́ Yowanɛsɩ lo otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ lo nuŋ tuwǝ sa we, wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ fǝ̀ Yowanɛsɩ le kǝnyiǝtǝkǝ we pǝ kolu pǝ ŋwàa.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lo koonu enyipǝ lafawǝ tʊʊ le keeriwǝ pǝ le ri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matewu 14:13-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yowanɛsɩ 6:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Enyikpiipǝ we Yesu ŋ kpìi gʊŋrǝ we, pǝ sìɛnɩ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kù rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ otuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ yeli mǝ otuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ kanǝ we, pǝ pɔ̀ na amayǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko pǝlǝ kpǝŋ, ǝpǝ pǝ lóo ko, ǝpǝ pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ. Nyikpǝŋwǝ sa wǝ ka naanǝ kǝto Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ laa nya eniyǝ pǝ leh ri ǝkǝŋtǝ. Wǝ kǝto ŋ tìi ne enyikpiipǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pǝ kǝ lo ko kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ rɛ, fɛɛwǝ enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ kǝlǝ wǝ kǝ nǝ ke tii nǝ wɛɛ tɩ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Wǝ́ pǝ fìi gʊrɔrǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ rɛ enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ kǝlǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ nyɩnɩ kǝ́ pǝ rùu pǝ lóo ko wǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ pǝ pǝ cìi. Wǝ́ enyipǝ rǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ sùu mǝ akparǝyǝ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi fɛɛwǝ we pǝ conu pǝ kòonu pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na sʊʊ rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we eni we, ŋ nyɩnɩ rǝ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ yaa! Wǝ́ wǝ cò na tǝlarǝwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ kǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ amɛɛpǝ pǝ lǝǝ lǝmǝ rǝŋtǝyǝ kǝtǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ pǝ lo otuyǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kǝ́ ǝrǝkǝ kǝ lah cɩɩ we, wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ rùu pǝ kǝ̀lǝ mǝ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ kǝlǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa, wǝ́ kǝ la marǝ kǝ lah cɩɩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Kǝto co enyipǝ sa la kʊŋ kǝ pǝ ŋ ko epwiitǝŋyǝ we mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝpiyǝ we yǝ kpii rǝ gaarǝ sa kǝ pǝ ko fuu tǝrɛ pǝ ri.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋnǝŋnǝ nǝ koonu pǝ pǝ ri.» Wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «We lo ko lo ko fuu kpɔnɔyǝ sɩkakpotokpotoyǝ tuuruyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɩkakpotokpotoyǝ sa we, ke ri sɩkamumuŋyǝ rɛ mǝ eniyǝ we.</char></note> lo po koonu pǝ pǝ ri?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpɔnɔyǝ paka wǝ́ nǝ re? Nǝ ko nǝ ka yɩrɩ!» Kǝ́ pǝ la ka yɩrɩ wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpɔnɔyǝ tʊʊ mǝ wǝpwɛɛkpǝ wǝyi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ pǝ sǝpǝ enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ tiini kuwǝ kpookpoo rǝ bɔɔkookoorǝ we lo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Wǝ́ pǝ ke ŋ tii mǝ arɔŋyǝ: Arɛɛpǝ tuuru, arɛɛpǝ tǝtʊʊ. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fǝ̀ kpɔnɔyǝ we tʊʊ mǝ wǝpwɛɛkpǝ we wǝyi. Wǝ́ ŋ yìili ŋ ka ŋ yɩrɩ oŋuŋkǝ, wǝ́ ŋ pɛ̀ɛrɩ yǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pòolu kpɔnɔyǝ we ŋ kòonu no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ fǝ pǝ sǝpǝ enyipǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ sǝ̀pǝ wǝpwɛɛkpǝ we wǝle wǝyi ŋ kòonu enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Wǝ́ pǝlo kpǝlo pǝ rili pǝ wulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wǝ́ pǝ rɛ̀mɩ akpɔnɔtooyǝ mǝ apwɛɛtoopiyǝ kɛŋtɛwǝ tǝ mǝ yi pǝ rè pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ǝpǝrǝŋpǝ we pǝ wolu kpɔnɔyǝ sa pǝ kǝ lǝ lafawǝ tʊʊ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la saŋ rǝ mɛŋwǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matewu 14:22-33</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yowanɛsɩ 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ fii gʊrɔrǝ pǝ coŋ pǝ ŋ ko kǝtakǝ lǝ gǝ eni kǝ kolu rǝ Bɛsayɩda wǝ. Eniyǝ we oturu ŋwǝ paa ya lóo co nyikpǝŋwǝ we la kʊŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Kǝ́ ŋ no co pǝla kʊŋ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ kolu dutupirǝ ŋ ka mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ǝrǝkǝ kǝ la cɩɩ, gʊrɔrǝ we ŋrǝ ŋkpɛ lo ko ro puŋkɔwǝ we le kǝtiitiikǝ. Yesu ceŋceŋ ŋ no tuuru ŋ yaa rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ya pǝ láa caa gʊrɔrǝ we pǝ ŋ faŋ kpiikǝ ǝrǝkǝ kǝ ko ŋ fuŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ kǝ ŋ ku mǝ pǝ rǝ kǝto. Rokoŋpikaalǝwǝ we wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu ŋ rù ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ pǝlǝ kpǝŋ, sanǝ rǝ mɛŋwǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ŋ sǝ pǝ ŋ tɛlɩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Kǝ́ pǝ la nyɩŋ ŋwǝ ŋ sanǝ rǝ mɛŋwǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ pù wǝ rǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ nyiǝtǝyǝ rɛ ŋ lǝǝwe. Wǝ́ pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ woolu. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Duturǝ ɖi pǝlo kpǝlo pǝ nyɩnɩ ŋwǝ wǝ́ vurǝ vìi pǝ ŋpa. Wǝ́ ŋwǝ paa ŋ wɛ̀ɛlɩ mǝ pǝ kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ ta nǝ wɛ! Ŋmǝ ŋ́ lǝǝwe! Nǝ poo suu vurǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Wǝ́ ŋ fìi gʊrɔrǝ we ŋ kolu ŋ tùu pǝ, wǝ́ ǝrǝfuŋkǝ we kǝ wɛ̀. Wǝ́ wǝ rili pǝlo mumuŋ ŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Duturǝ ɖi pǝ loo nuŋ kpɔnɔyǝ sa Yesu ŋ sǝ̀pǝ le dierǝ sa lo duturǝ, pǝlo yupurǝ laa saanǝ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá enyipǝ rǝ Genezarɛtǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matewu 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Kǝ́ pǝ la ka ta puŋkɔwǝ sa pǝ la lɛ we, wǝ́ pǝ fìi Genezarɛtǝ la gaarǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ yàalǝ gʊrɔrǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo ru rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we eni we, wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ nyɩnɩ Yesu pǝ cìi. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ sìri gaarǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ tɛ̀lɩ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ anyaatǝpǝ pǝ ŋ re mǝ pǝlǝ ǝfǝŋkǝyǝ pǝ ŋ pǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ lo nuŋ Yesu ŋ nya ŋ kpii rǝ ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ Yesu ŋ ke ŋ fìi we, wǝ ke ri dǝŋtǝǝpirǝ, tǝŋtǝǝwǝ, epwiiyǝ, pǝ ŋ ru mǝ anyaatǝpǝ pǝ tǝnǝ rǝ canɩyǝ. Pǝ ka ŋ tɔɔ pǝ ŋ kpɛɛ ŋwǝ ŋ maa pǝ pǝ rɔsɩ pǝ ruu rǝ na kǝkpakǝ la laawǝ rǝ ǝkǝŋtǝ! Wǝ́ epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ ko ŋ ruu ŋwǝ we, pǝ kpàa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Oyudatǝpǝ lǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ lo kǝsuŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Matewu 15:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Jirɛɛrǝ wǝ́ Afarisitǝpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ rɛ pǝ rù rǝ Yerusalɛmǝ, pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kù rǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ Yesu lo otukarǝtǝrɛɛpǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée ri mǝ wǝkaakpǝ mǝ arɛɛyǝ, wǝlo duturǝ ɖi ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ laa naŋ pǝ saŋ rǝ pǝlo kǝsuŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Wǝ ri rǝ kǝsuŋkǝ wǝ koonu Oyudatǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ otukpǝlo Afarisitǝpǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ láa naŋ sɩsiɛrɩ kpɛŋ ǝ pǝ ŋ ci eri mǝŋ kǝ́ pǝlǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ pǝ ke ŋ yee wǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Vǝ́ pǝ lo ru rǝ wǝraakpǝ pǝ le pe fii we, pǝ láa wɛɛ pǝla wɛ kpɛŋ pǝ ŋ ci eri. Wǝsuŋpʊŋpwaakpǝ wa wǝ kpii pǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ pǝ ŋ yee mǝŋ kǝ́ pǝlǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ pǝ ke ŋ yee wǝ kǝtǝ: Kǝ́ pǝ láa wɛɛ akɔpʊyǝ, akpɛɛyǝ mǝ akpɛtɛlɛpǝ pǝ ŋ fǝ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Wǝ kǝto Afarisitǝpǝ we mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ we pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ló otukarǝtǝpǝ sa pǝ lǝŋ yee pǝ saŋ rǝ lǝh ǝtǝtǝpǝ lo kǝsuŋkǝ wǝ? Wǝ́ pǝ lǝŋ naŋ sɩsiɛrɩ kpɛŋ kǝ pǝ ci eri wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ezaya la pɛŋ kǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ dierǝ ŋ tǝ̀nǝ ŋ rù rǝ nǝ wǝ. Tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ, alakpatǝpǝ wǝ́ nǝ ri kǝceece. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ la ŋʊrʊ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Kǝkpǝŋkǝ sa kǝ lǝ́ǝ kǝ mǝ mǝ nyuŋkpǝ ko feepi wǝǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">paa kǝla ziɔŋrǝ lǝǝrǝ mǝ mǝ.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Tuŋtuŋ wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ láa sʊma mǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">duturǝ ɖi otukaŋyǝ we pǝ ya pǝ láa kaŋ we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">anyɩmaasɩpǝ le esepǝ pǝ lǝǝwe.”» <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nya cɛ Worokoyǝ le seyǝ nǝ nyǝ tǝnǝ, wǝ́ paa nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee rǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ lo kǝsuŋkǝ».<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ sǝ́ŋ Worokoyǝ le seyǝ kpaŋkpasaŋ, kǝ nǝ nya fɛɛ nǝ mǝ yee nǝ kǝsuŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Duturǝ ɖi Mose la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Pu lǝ́ tǝ mǝ lé lee”, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ tǝ ŋ na tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Yǝ we ŋ náa tɛŋ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ rɛ ŋ tíi nǝ tǝ amaa ne lee we, wǝ kpii kǝ pǝ wʊ ŋwǝ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Paa ŋnǝ we, nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kaŋ otuyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Mǝŋ rɛ le tíi nǝ tǝ amaa ne lee ǝkǝnǝŋ: Tuwǝ we ŋ́ kǝ fǝ ŋ́ toŋ lǝ́ we, wǝ le yee kɔrǝbaŋyǝ, wǝlo duturǝ ɖi ŋ́ nǝ fǝ wǝ ŋ́ no koonu Worokoyǝ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Nǝ nyo koonu yǝ we la gʊŋrǝ ŋ pǝǝ tǝ ŋ yee tǝrɛ ŋ koonu nǝ tǝ amaa ne lee! <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Kǝ́ nǝ nye yee wǝ́ nǝ nya nyarǝ Worokoyǝ le dierǝ we nǝ nyo co wǝǝ! Wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee nyǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ nǝ kǝsuŋkǝ sa nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kaŋ awɛ wǝ. Wǝ́ nǝ tǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa lǝ kǝtǝŋkǝ wa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuyǝ we yǝ láa cɩɩrɩ nyiyǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matewu 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Rǝ wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ kpǝ̀lǝŋ ŋ pwò kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ we ŋ pǝlǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ mǝ kpǝŋ nǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ nǝ nuŋ tuwǝ sa lo duturǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Tǝrɛ wǝ lee kpii rǝ dǝǝtǝǝrǝ sa wǝ lée fii nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ kǝ wǝ cɩɩrɩ ŋwǝ. Paa tuwǝ we wǝ lóo ru rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋ wǝ wǝ láa cɩɩrɩ ŋwǝ wǝ.» [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mǝŋ rɛ lǝǝmǝ otukoŋyǝ ŋ nóo nuŋ we, kǝ ŋ nuŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛkǝwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note>] <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na pwɛyɩ rǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we lǝ kpǝŋ ŋ ne ke fii nyarǝwǝ we, wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ŋ pɔrʊ no duturǝ we ŋ na ca lǝ mǝrǝ ŋ tíi pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «We ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ nǝ foo nuŋ tǝrɛ lo duturǝ? Nǝ nyee ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tǝrɛ wǝ lǝŋ ru rǝ dǝǝtǝǝrǝ wǝ fii nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ kǝ wǝ cɩɩrɩ ŋwǝ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Duturǝ ɖi tuwǝ sa wǝ lǝŋ fii rǝ yǝ we la ziɔŋrǝ, paa wǝ lée fii rǝ na lɛrǝ, ŋ ka ca wǝ ŋ co rǝ tɔwǝ.» Yesu pɔ̀rʊ wǝ kanǝ rǝ na awɛɛlɩkǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ekeeriyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ kaamǝ erikǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tuwǝ we wǝ lóo ru rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋ wǝ wǝ láa cɩɩrɩ nyɩmaasɩyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Duturǝ ɖi nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ, na ziɔŋrǝ mǝrǝ, wǝ́ oyupurɔɔrɔɔyǝ yǝ lóo ru wǝ. Nuŋruwǝ, ayɩɩkǝ, kǝnyiwʊkǝ, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kǝtienaakǝ amaa vuuyɩɩrǝ, nimimwɛɛrɩwǝ, yulɛnyɩrǝ, kǝnyitǝǝnǝkǝ, kǝtʊkpaakǝ, wǝtɛlɩkpǝ, kǝnyitɛŋkǝ, wɛɛfǝrɛɛrɩwǝ, otuleeciyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ŋyǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ we yǝ lóo ru rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ a yǝ ŋ cɩɩrɩ ŋwǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tieyǝ rɛ ŋ nee ri Oyudatǝpǝ la lɔ Yesu lo nuŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matewu 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa, wǝ́ ŋ ko ŋ ko Tiro la gaarǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ fìi nyarǝwǝ rɛ, lǝǝ pǝ́ rɛ ŋ ci wǝ ŋwǝ ŋ kpii rǝ nyarǝwǝ we. Paape loo kòru aŋwaa na wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Wǝ́ tieyǝ rɛ na gɔrʊpirǝ ge kpii mǝ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we, ŋ nunu pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛŋ Yesu lo tuwǝ. Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ tɔ̀ɔ ŋ kʊnʊ rǝ Yesu la wǝkʊŋkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Tieyǝ sa lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ, pǝ mǝnǝ ŋwǝ rǝ Fenisi wǝ kpii rǝ Siri wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tɔ̀ɔ ŋ kpɛlɩ ŋwǝ ŋ piri wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we ŋ ru rǝ na gɔrʊpirǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Maa kǝ epipǝ pǝ ri pǝ wu kpɛŋ. Duturǝ ɖi wǝ laa laka kǝ pǝ fǝ epipǝ le keeriwǝ pǝ co acɩkɛɛpipǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Wǝ́ tieyǝ sa ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kulǝtǝyǝ, wǝ lǝ ǝnǝ! Paape acɩkɛɛpipǝ we pǝ kpɛlɩ rǝ kpǝlɔyǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ we, pǝ lée ri epipǝ le ekeeritupiyǝ we yǝ lo puulu yǝ la tɔɔlʊ wǝ». <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Dierǝ sa a la tɛŋ kǝto we, mǝ ko, wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we lo ru rǝ lá gɔrʊpirǝ we.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Wǝ́ tieyǝ sa ŋ kpǝ̀lǝŋ ŋ ko ŋ ko nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ nyɩnɩ ne piyǝ kpɛlɩ rǝ gacarǝ, wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we lo ru rǝ ŋwǝ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá owuuyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:29-31">Matewu 15:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ rǝ Tiro la gaarǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ rǝ Zidɔŋ, ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ tɛ̀lɩ Dekapolǝ la gaarǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋ ko ŋ ko rǝ Galileya lo puŋkɔwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ loonuŋtǝyǝ rɛ ŋ náa lɛ mǝ ŋ wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ faŋ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kòonu ŋwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ tɔ̀ɔ pǝ kpɛlɩ ŋwǝ ŋ tɛɛ na akaakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ cɛ̀ rǝ enyipǝ sa lǝ kpǝŋ ŋ kolu kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ na akaapiyǝ ŋ kpìi nyiyǝ we rǝ otukoŋyǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tòo dutomirǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tà dutomirǝ we ŋ tɛ̀ɛ ŋwǝ rǝ kǝroŋfwɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yìili ŋ yɩ̀rɩ oŋuŋkǝ, wǝ́ ŋ wɛ̀ ŋ sùu. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi nyiyǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Efata». Wǝlo duturǝ ɖi: «Taanǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ no otukoŋyǝ yǝ tàanǝ, wǝ́ na kǝraakpakǝ kǝ sàanǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ pǝlɛpǝlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpìi seyǝ ŋ kòonu pǝ pǝ paa ka tɛŋ tuwǝ sa pǝ tíi rɛ. Paape eniyǝ we ŋ ya ŋ náa nyɩɩ mǝŋ kpii seyǝ sa mǝ ŋ koonu pǝ we, ǝ pǝ ŋ mǝ nyɩɩ pǝ ŋ tǝ pǝ ŋ tɛŋ wǝ pǝ ŋ tɛlɩ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Wǝ́ wǝ rili enyipǝ lo mumuŋ ŋpaŋpa, wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Otuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ ŋ ne yee we, yǝ ponu kwa! Lo koonu oloonuŋtǝpǝ pǝ ya pǝ lóo nuŋ, wǝ́ omuumuupǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu lo koonu enyipǝ lafawǝ niǝ le keeriwǝ pǝ le ri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matewu 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Rǝ eciyǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ we, wǝ́ kǝnyikpǝŋmumuŋkǝ rɛ kǝ tǝ kǝ pǝlǝ kǝ kù. Anyɩŋ kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ sa kǝ lǝǝ kǝ lǝmǝ tuwǝ kǝ leh ri. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwò no otukarǝtǝpǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ sa lo tuwǝ wǝ ya wǝ lóo co mǝ tǝlarǝwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi wǝ la marǝ wǝ le yee wǝcukpǝ wǝta kǝ́ pǝ yaa rǝ mǝ kpǝŋ wǝǝ, wǝ́ pǝ lee re tǝrɛ pǝ láa nya pǝ ri. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Mǝŋ ŋ́ no co pǝ la kʊŋ mǝ lɛkpaakpaarǝ ǝnǝ we, pǝ lóo koru a ka tɔɔ sipopokuyǝ rǝ kʊŋwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi, arɛɛpǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ fɛɛlǝǝrǝwǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Fǝŋ wǝ́ yǝ lah nya keeriwǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa nyiyǝ ŋ nǝǝ kǝlǝ lo koonu enyipǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ ri pǝ wu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpɔnɔyǝ paka wǝ́ nǝ re?» Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝrɩmata». <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ sɔ wǝ tii rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ kpɔnɔyǝ we na pǝrɩmata, kǝ́ ŋ ne ceeni Worokoyǝ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ pòolu ŋwǝ ŋ kòonu no otukarǝtǝpǝ we, kǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ sǝpǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Pǝ ka lɛ pǝ re wǝpwɛɛpikpǝ rɛ tɩ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pɛ̀ɛrɩ kpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ fǝ̀ kpǝ ŋ wǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ sǝ̀pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Wǝ́ pǝ rili pǝ wulu. Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ wʊ̀ʊ otoopiyǝ we yǝ lo turu kɛŋtɛwǝ pǝrɩmata pǝ rè pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Enyipǝ we pǝ lǝh mǝ lǝ mǝŋ lafawǝ niǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ cò pǝla kʊŋ. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fìi gʊrɔrǝ ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ wǝ́ ŋ ko ŋ ko Dalǝmanuta la gaarǝ.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu ŋ yee tucovurǝ rɛ ŋ kaŋ pǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-39">Matewu 12:38-39</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:16-29">Luka 11:16-29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Afarisitǝpǝ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ pǝ kɔŋ Yesu la kpɛrɛwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ ke ŋ tiini etieyǝ mǝ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ŋ yee tucovurǝ rɛ wǝ láa pɔrʊ wǝ kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ ŋ ne kpii ŋwǝ ŋ na maŋ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ wɛ̀ɛ ŋ sùu ŋpaŋpa, wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ruŋruŋ le enyipǝ sa pǝ ya pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ tucovurǝ wǝ? Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, pǝ lǝŋ pe yee tucovurǝ rɛ mǝŋ ceŋceŋ pǝ kaŋ ruŋruŋ le enyipǝ sa!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Wǝ́ ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ ŋ màa pǝ ŋ kolu ŋ fìi gʊrɔrǝ ŋ ko ŋ ko kǝtakǝ lǝ gǝ eni.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ laa ya pǝ lóo nuŋ Yesu lo tutɛŋwǝ lo duturǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matewu 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ yulu kpɛɛ pǝ lǝǝ fǝ kpɔnɔyǝ. Kpɔnɔyǝ ceŋceŋ ko ŋ ke kpii pǝ rǝ gʊrɔrǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ cìi ŋ kanǝ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ yee yurǝ! Nǝ ci nǝ wɛ le ere rǝ Afarisitǝpǝ la dafaŋrǝ mǝ Erodɛsɩ la dafaŋrǝ lǝ kpǝŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ya pǝ ke ŋ kpii dierǝ sa pǝ ŋ pɔrʊ, kpiikǝ pǝ lee ke re kpɔnɔyǝ kǝto. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nyɩnɩ wǝ ŋ cìi. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée kpii dierǝ nǝ nyǝ ŋ pɔrʊ kpiikǝ nǝ nyee re kpɔnɔyǝ kǝto wǝ? Nǝ faa maa nǝ nuŋ tǝrɛ lo duturǝ? Nǝ faa maa nǝ nyɩŋ tǝrɛ nǝ ci? Nǝ mɔlɩɩyǝ faa taanǝ nǝ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Nǝ lǝǝmǝ enimiyǝ paape wǝ́ nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ? Nǝ lǝǝmǝ otukoŋyǝ paape wǝ́ nǝ nyǝŋ nuŋ? Kǝto nǝ nyǝŋ taalǝ? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Kǝ́ ŋ́ sǝ̀pǝ kpɔnɔyǝ tʊʊ ŋ́ kòonu enyipǝ lafawǝ tʊʊ wǝǝ, nǝ rɛ̀mɩ otoopiyǝ we nǝ lǝ̀ǝrǝ kɛŋtɛwǝ paka nǝ rè nǝ pwɛ̀yɩ?» Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tǝ mǝ yi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ́ kǝ́ ŋ́ sǝ̀pǝ kpɔnɔyǝ pǝrɩmata ŋ́ kòonu enyipǝ lafawǝ niǝ wǝǝ, nǝ rɛ̀mɩ otoopiyǝ we nǝ lǝ̀ǝrǝ kɛŋtɛwǝ paka nǝ rè nǝ pwɛ̀yɩ?» Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝrɩmata.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ́ nǝ foo nuŋ tǝrɛ lo duturǝ?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá laanyɩŋtǝyǝ rɛ rǝ Bɛsayɩda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi Bɛsayɩda. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ fǝ̀ laanyɩŋtǝyǝ rɛ pǝ pǝlǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ, wǝ́ pǝ tɔ̀ɔ pǝ kpɛlɩ ŋwǝ ŋ ruu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tà nyiyǝ sa rǝ akaakǝ, wǝ́ ŋ rùu mǝ ŋwǝ ŋ cɛ̀ rǝ dǝŋtǝǝpirǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ yeli mǝ dutomirǝ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ ne enimiyǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ na wǝkaakpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A ya láa nyɩŋ tǝrɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Kǝ́ laanyɩŋtǝyǝ sa ŋ no wuru enimiyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa nyɩŋ enyipǝ, pǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ eciiyǝ kǝtǝ, paa pǝ ya pǝ láa saŋ». <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ nyiyǝ sa la wǝkaakpǝ rǝ enimiyǝ. Kǝ́ ŋ no wuru yǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ kpàa, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ nyɩŋ sɩsiɛrɩ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ cò na kʊŋ mǝ ŋ ko nyarǝwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pee ce e fii dǝŋtǝǝpirǝ sa ǝkǝŋtǝ».<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtǝro la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu ŋ ri Mesiyayǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matewu 16:13-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fǝ̀ ŋ ko ŋ ko rǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝpiyǝ we yǝ maarǝ mǝ Sezare Filipo ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ. Pǝ kpii pǝ lóo ko we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Enyipǝ pǝ láa tɛŋ ŋmǝ ŋ́ ri ǝlǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Arɛɛpǝ pǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ e ri Yowanɛsɩ worokomɛŋwiiritǝyǝ we, arɛɛpǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ e ri Eliya, apʊŋpwapǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ oworokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ le ceŋceŋ». <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ́ ŋnǝ pa, ǝlǝ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa tɛŋ ŋmǝ ŋ́ ri wǝ?» Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ lɔ̀ɔ kpɛɛwǝ wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ e ri Mesiyayǝ we». <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kanǝ ŋ tìi pǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ paa tɛŋ wǝ pǝ tíi rɛ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ nǝ ǝkpǝ́kǝ mǝ na asaanǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Matewu 16:21-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìe no otukarǝtǝpǝ lo otukaŋyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ kpii kǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋ cʊʊrʊ ŋpa, kǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ, otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ, mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ sǝ́ŋ ŋwǝ pǝ co, pǝ láa wʊ ŋwǝ, kǝ juutatǝrǝ ŋ saanǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yà ke ŋ tíi pǝlo tuwǝ sa feŋteŋ. Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ kpàrǝ ŋwǝ ŋ rù kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ, wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ kpamǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sìɛrɩ ŋ yɩ̀rɩ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ kpanǝ mǝ Pɛtǝro ŋpa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ruu o ru rǝ mǝ kpǝŋ! Tɛlɩ o ko mǝ kǝmaakǝ Satana! Duturǝ ɖi ló oyupuyǝ yǝ lee ri Worokoyǝ la anɛŋyǝ, paa anyɩmaasɩpǝ la anɛŋyǝ yǝ lǝǝwe.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwò kǝnyikpǝŋkǝ we mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we ŋ pǝlǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ rɛ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ siimǝ mǝ we, yǝ we ŋ yuu na wɛ la kpɛɛ ŋ co, kǝ ŋ fǝ na kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ ŋ re kǝ ŋ siimǝ mǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Duturǝ ɖi yǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ pɔrʊ na wɛ la vɔrʊrǝ we, lǝ́ǝ lǝǝrǝ rǝ. Paa yǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ rǝ mǝ yurǝ mǝ Dieceeceerǝ we lo yurǝ we, yǝ we láa pɔrʊ na vɔrʊrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ la nya ǝrǝkǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lo otuyǝ wǝ́ ŋ nǝ lǝǝrǝ na vɔrʊrǝ wǝǝ, vasʊyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ ŋ na nya? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Kǝ́ lo tu wǝ́ nyɩmaasɩyǝ ŋ nóo koru ǝ fǝ ŋ cɛkɛlɛ mǝ na vɔrʊrǝ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Duturǝ ɖi yǝ we ŋ nóo suu ŋlǝ mǝ mǝ etieyǝ la nʊŋsɔɔwǝ rǝ ruŋruŋ le enyipǝ sa pǝ laa lɔ pǝ nuŋ, pǝ lée yee oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋmǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋmǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ́ noh po suu yǝ we la nʊŋsɔɔwǝ jirǝ we ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ ŋlǝ mǝ epicoŋpikenikenipǝ rǝ mǝ Tǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, rǝ enyipǝ sa pǝ yaa rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ we, arɛɛpǝ pǝ lǝŋ kpǝ́ kpɛŋ kǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ wǝ ci ǝpǝ mǝ okopiyǝ».<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lo otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ la nyɩŋ Yesu rǝ Worokoyǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matewu 17:1-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Juu kʊʊraŋ la kǝmaakǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fǝ̀ Pɛtǝro, Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ ŋ kʊ̀la mǝ na wɛ ŋ re ŋ kolu kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ rǝ dutupikǝŋrǝ rɛ lo oŋuŋkǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu lǝ wǝlǝkpǝ wǝ sìɛrɩ rǝ pǝle enimiyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Wǝ́ na wǝkpakpǝ wǝ kpɛ̀ɛlɩ fuu, wǝ́ wǝ ke ŋ sie ŋaŋa. Rɛ lee kpii rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ ŋ nóo koru awɛ tuwǝ kǝ wǝ kpɛɛlɩ ǝnǝ kʊrakʊra. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ kǝ́ Eliya mǝ Mose pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛɛrɩ mǝ Yesu wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tìi Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, wǝ ponu kǝ le tii rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa. Yǝ láa tɔ epwiiyǝ ata, lá nɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ, Mose la nɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ, Eliya la nɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pɛtǝro lee ke ci wǝ ŋ nah tɛŋ duturǝ ɖi pǝlo kpǝlo pǝ fìi vurǝ ŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Wǝ́ ŋɔɔrǝ rɛ bǝlǝ zìi pǝ, wǝ́ pǝ nunu kpɛɛwǝ rɛ rǝ ŋɔɔrǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ ǝnǝ ŋ ri mǝ piyǝ ŋ́ náa taa kǝǝwǝ wǝ. Nǝ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ ŋwǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ ko, wǝ́ pǝ yɩ̀rɩ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ ku, pǝ lǝǝ tǝ pǝ nyɩŋ rɛ ŋ yaa rǝ pǝlǝ kpǝŋ, we Yesu ceŋceŋ ko.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo ru rǝ dutupirǝ we pǝ láa sʊʊ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpìi seyǝ ŋ kòonu pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ paa tɛŋ tuwǝ sa pǝ la nyɩŋ pǝ tíi rɛ ko ro ǝrǝ kǝ́ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋ náa saanǝ ŋ ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Wǝ́ pǝ lɔ̀ dierǝ sa pǝ kpìi rǝ yurǝ. Paa wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tuwǝ sa ŋ na tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ “ŋ saanǝ ŋ ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ” lo duturǝ ɖi nɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ wǝ kpii kǝ Eliya ŋ pǝ kpɛŋ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝceece, Eliya lǝ́ǝ pǝ ŋ coonu kǝ ŋ po toolu tu ri ŋ tu ŋ tǝnǝ. Rǝkǝsa kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ pǝ la ŋʊrʊ pǝ lo ru rǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ǝkǝnǝŋ láa cʊʊrʊ ŋpa kǝ pǝ sǝ́ŋ ŋwǝ pǝ co wǝ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kǝto ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Eliya la marǝ ǝpǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ le yee mǝ ŋwǝ tuwǝ we wǝ ponu mǝ pǝ wǝ, mǝŋ kǝ́ pǝ la ŋʊrʊ pǝ lo ru rǝ ŋwǝ kǝtǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la cá piyǝ rɛ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ gbii rǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matewu 17:14-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo po tuu otukarǝtǝtuturupǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ lo co pǝ le siri pǝ, wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ lée tiini etieyǝ mǝ pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Kǝ́ nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ la nyɩŋ Yesu we, wǝ́ wǝ rili pǝ lo mumuŋ. Wǝ́ pǝ sùu pǝ ko ŋ ko pǝ ke ceeni ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ otukarǝtǝpǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ le die wǝ́ ŋnǝ mǝ pǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyée tiini?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Wǝ́ nyiyǝ rɛ rǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ ŋ yìili ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, ŋ́ nǝ fǝ mǝ bǝrǝŋpirǝ sa ŋ́ nǝ pǝ lǝ́ kpǝŋ. Wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ rɛ gbii rǝ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ le yee mǝ ŋwǝ lǝŋ tǝ ŋ wɛɛlɩ. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ wɛɛrǝ sa lo ro ŋwǝ la ta ko, ǝ lǝ ŋ fǝ ŋwǝ gbǝ ja rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ, oturu dutomirǝ ya lóo ru ŋwǝ fʊkʊfʊkʊ, ŋ mǝ wo oroŋciiyǝ kǝrǝrǝkǝrǝrǝ anyɩŋ la nwiɛnɩ tʊrʊrʊ. Ŋ́ ne tìi ló otukarǝtǝpǝ sa pǝ piri rǝ paape pǝ loo koru.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tà ŋ yìili ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋnǝ rǝkǝsa le enyipǝ, nǝ nyaa lɔ nǝ nuŋ! Ŋ́ tǝ ŋ́ tii ŋ́ kʊla mǝ nǝ ko ro ɖeci? Ŋ́ tǝ ŋ́ re nǝ ko ro ɖeci? Nǝ fǝ piyǝ we nǝ pǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ piyǝ we pǝ pǝlǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ. Kǝ́ wɛɛrǝ we la nya la nyɩŋ Yesu we, wǝ́ dìkili piyǝ we mǝ okopiyǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ rù ŋ tɔɔ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝǝlǝ. Wǝ́ dutomirǝ ya go ŋ ru ŋwǝ rǝ nyuŋkpǝ fʊkʊfʊkʊ. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ piyǝ we lǝ tǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Eniyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ nyarǝpirǝ sa le tie ŋwǝ?» Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝrǝ na kǝlaatiepikǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Enirɛɛyǝ we, wɛɛrǝ we lóo tu ŋwǝ lǝ ŋ kpii rǝ naawǝ amaa mɛŋwǝ, kǝ nya fɛɛ wʊ ŋwǝ. Kǝto mǝŋ o lóo koru tǝrɛ le eyee we, nyɩŋ lǝ tǝlarǝwǝ, kǝ a pa lɔ o koonu lǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «He, a ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ mǝ mǝŋ ŋ́ nóo koru tǝrɛ le eyee wǝ? Tǝrɛ wǝ laa lɛnyɩ wǝ koonu yǝ we ŋ na lɔ ŋ no nuŋ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ wǝ́ piyǝ we lǝ tǝ ŋ tɛnɩ kelele ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ na lɔ ŋ́ no nuŋ! Pǝ a pa lɔ o koonu mǝ, duturǝ ɖi mǝ lɔnuŋrǝ laa naanǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na nyɩŋ kǝ́ nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ ya wǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ wǝ ŋ ku we, wǝ́ ŋ fanǝ wɛɛrɔɔrɔɔrǝ we ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ wɛɛrǝ we le yee mǝ piyǝ sa wǝ́ ŋ nǝŋ tǝ ŋ wɛɛlɩ wǝ́ ŋ nǝŋ lɛ ŋ tǝ ŋ nuŋ wǝ, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi lǝ́, tɛlɩ o ru rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ kǝ ǝ pǝǝ tǝ a ka siɛnɩ ǝ pǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Wǝ́ wɛɛrǝ we yà ga ŋ lɔ anarǝyǝ, wǝ́ ge ŋ tikili piyǝ we mǝ okopiyǝ, wǝ́ ɖù. Wǝ́ wǝ yeli mǝŋ piyǝ we lǝ kpǝ́ rǝ. Kǝto nyi ri ŋ nyi yà ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Lǝ kpǝ́!» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Paape wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tà ŋwǝ rǝ kǝnukǝ ŋ yìili, wǝ́ ŋ yili ŋ yàa. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ ne ke fii nyarǝwǝ, ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ sɔŋ pǝ tini we, wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ŋlǝ paa yǝ loo koru wɛɛrǝ we le epiri wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wɛɛrǝ sa kǝtǝŋkǝ we, nyuŋmwɛŋwǝ ko wǝ lóo koru epiri rǝ».<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lǝ tǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ nǝh pǝ kpǝ́ kǝ ŋ saanǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matewu 17:22-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Kǝ́ pǝ la pwɛyɩ rǝ we we, wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ sǝ̀ Galileya pǝ tɛ̀lɩ pǝ ko ŋ ko. Yesu lǝǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ ci wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Duturǝ ɖi ka ŋ kaŋ no otukarǝtǝpǝ lo otuyǝ wǝ́ ŋ ke ŋ tíi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi pǝ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ. Pǝ láa wʊ ŋwǝ. Vǝ́ pǝ la wʊ ŋwǝ juutatǝrǝ we, láa saanǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Paape otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ loo ko ŋ nuŋ dierǝ sa lo duturǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ lɛ pǝ ko ŋ suu vurǝ kǝ́ pǝ lée yee kǝ pǝ pǝ́ ne dierǝ wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ǝlǝ ŋ ri mumuŋyǝ rǝ otukarǝtǝpǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matewu 18:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Wǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi Kapɛrǝnawumǝ. Kǝ́ pǝ le ke fii nyarǝwǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Dierǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyeh tiini rǝ gʊŋrǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ rǝnǝ yiriri, duturǝ ɖi pǝ la ya pǝ leh tiini etieyǝ mǝ awɛ, kǝ pǝ ci yǝ we ŋ ri mumuŋyǝ rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sɔ ŋ tini wǝ́ ŋ pwò enyikpiipǝ we pǝlǝ tǝ mǝ eyi, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ rɛ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ ri sǝsǝŋyǝ we, wǝ kpii kǝ yǝ we ŋ fǝ na wɛ ŋ yee enyikpǝlo lǝ tǝtǝǝlǝyǝ mǝ enyikpǝlo la sʊmatǝyǝ». <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ laatiepiyǝ rɛ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ yàalǝ rǝ pǝle kǝtiitiikǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pùru ŋwǝ ŋ rè, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Yǝ we ŋ náa tɛɛnɩ ŋ lɔ piyǝ rɛ mǝŋ yǝ ǝnǝ rǝ mǝ yurǝ we, ŋmǝŋmǝ wǝ́ yǝ we ŋ na lɔ. Wǝ́ yǝ we ŋ na tɛɛnɩ ŋ na lɔ mǝ we, ŋkǝ ŋmǝ wǝ́ ŋ na lɔ, yǝ we ŋ ne kpii mǝ wǝ́ ŋ na lɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yǝ we ŋ nee yi ŋ tɛɛ rǝ lǝ we, kʊla mǝ lǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Wǝ́ Yowanɛsɩ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, yǝ la nyɩŋ nyiyǝ rɛ ya lée piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ saŋ rǝ lá nyɩŋrǝ. Yǝ lǝ pǝ́ lǝ kǝ sǝ́ŋ wǝ lo koonu ŋwǝ duturǝ ɖi lee siimǝ lǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pǝǝ sǝ́ŋ wǝ nǝ koonu ŋwǝ duturǝ ɖi rɛ lee kpii ŋ née yee tucovurǝ rǝ mǝ nyɩŋrǝ ŋ lɛ, wǝla kǝmaakǝ kǝ ŋ ka wɛɛlɩ rɔɔrɔ ŋ ru rǝ mǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Yǝ we ŋ nee yi ŋ tɛɛ rǝ lǝ we, kʊla mǝ lǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Yǝ we ŋ nóo koonu nǝ mɛŋwǝ kɔpʊwǝ ceŋceŋ mǝ kǝ́ nǝ ri Kǝriso le enyipǝ kǝto we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, yǝ we láa lɔ wǝlo wǝtoomwarakpǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yǝ we ŋ no tu na kɛrɩyǝ ŋ ne kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ láa lɔ tukoŋtawǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matewu 18:6-9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Mǝŋ rɛ lo tu epipǝ sa pǝ la lɔ mǝ pǝ lo nuŋ la rɛ le kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, mǝŋ pǝ le kpii yǝ we lǝ wǝtǝǝmumuŋkpǝ rɛ rǝ dǝreerǝ wǝ́ pǝ lǝ fǝ ŋwǝ pǝ le tie pǝ le kpii rǝ apʊyǝ we, wǝ lóo poŋ ŋwǝ wǝ teeri. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Mǝŋ lá akaakǝ kǝ lóo kuŋ kǝ e yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, we sǝ kǝ. Mǝŋ o lo ko vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ mǝ kǝnukǝ kǝceŋceŋ we, wǝ ponu wǝ teeri kǝ́ o lo ko naalaalɛɛwǝ mǝ lá wǝkaakpǝ wǝyi wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Fɛɛwǝ we wǝ́ owuupǝ pǝ lǝŋ kpǝ́ wǝ, wǝ́ naawǝ wǝ lǝŋ rǝŋ kʊrakʊra wǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Mǝŋ lá kǝkparǝkǝ kǝ lóo kuŋ kǝ e yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, we sǝ kǝ. Mǝŋ o lo ko vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ mǝ kǝkparǝkǝ kǝceŋceŋ we, wǝ ponu wǝ teeri kǝ́ pǝ le tie lǝ́ pǝ le kpii rǝ naalaalɛɛwǝ mǝ lá wǝkparǝkpǝ wǝyi wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Fɛɛwǝ we wǝ́ owuupǝ pǝ lǝŋ kpǝ́ wǝ, wǝ́ naawǝ wǝ lǝŋ rǝŋ kʊrakʊra wǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ lé nimirǝ lóo kuŋ kǝ e yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, pɔrʊ rǝ. Mǝŋ o lo ko Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ mǝ nimirǝ jeŋceŋ we, wǝ ponu wǝ teeri kǝ́ pǝ le tie lǝ́ pǝ le kpii rǝ naalaalɛɛwǝ mǝ lé enimiyǝ eyi wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Fɛɛwǝ we wǝ́ owuupǝ pǝ lǝŋ kpǝ́ wǝ, wǝ́ naawǝ wǝ lǝŋ rǝŋ kʊrakʊra wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Duturǝ ɖi pǝ lée fieni nyi ri ŋ nyi la naawǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ pǝ lé kpii atǝraŋpǝ rǝ keeriwǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Atǝraŋpǝ pǝ ri tuceeceewǝ rɛ. Paa mǝŋ atǝraŋpǝ pǝ lǝ lǝǝrǝ pǝla wǝraŋkpǝ wǝǝ, kǝ́ wǝ́ nǝ nyǝ́ǝ tǝ nǝ fǝ nǝ raanǝ pǝ wǝ? Nǝ raŋ mǝŋ atǝraŋpǝ kǝtǝ, kǝ nǝ tii mǝ awɛ rǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ dielɔrǝ mǝ kǝtiesǝ́ŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matewu 19:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na pwɛyɩ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we we, wǝ́ ŋ ko ŋ ko Yudeya la gaarǝ rǝ Yɔrǝdaŋ la kǝtakǝ lǝ gǝ eni. Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ tǝ wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ kù rǝ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ pǝ lo otuyǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ ŋ née ce mǝ ŋ yee wǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Wǝ́ Afarisitǝpǝ rɛ pǝ rùu pǝ kǝlǝ mǝ Yesu. Pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ pǝ kɔŋ na kpɛrɛwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝ la pɔrʊ gʊŋrǝ pǝ lo koonu pǝrǝŋyǝ ŋ sǝ́ŋ ne tieyǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Seyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ Mose ŋ ne kpii ŋ no koonu nǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mose la pɔrʊ gʊŋrǝ lo koonu pǝrǝŋyǝ ŋ ŋʊrʊ kǝraŋsiefwɛɛkǝ kǝ láa kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ lǝ sǝ́ŋ ne tie, kpɛŋ kǝ ŋ ci anyarǝ ŋwǝ ŋ co.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ yulɛnyɩrǝ kǝto wǝ́ Mose ŋ na ŋʊrʊ seyǝ sa ŋ no koonu nǝ ǝnǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kaŋfɩ ǝrǝ ǝrǝkǝ lǝ kǝsǝsǝŋkǝ we, Worokoyǝ cò pǝrǝŋyǝ mǝ tieyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Fɛɛwǝ kǝto pǝrǝŋyǝ ŋ náa pwɛyɩ rǝ nǝ tǝ mǝ ne lee lǝ kpǝŋ ŋ ka maarǝ mǝ ne tie. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Pǝle eyi pǝ ŋ siɛrɩ pǝ yee nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, pǝ lǝǝ tǝ pǝ lǝ enyi eyi paa nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kǝto rɛ ŋ pǝǝ sǝpǝ tuwǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na ca ŋ ne kpii rǝ awɛ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Kǝ́ pǝ le ke fii nyarǝwǝ we, wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ tǝ pǝ pǝ̀ ne etieyǝ pǝ rù rǝ dierǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ lǝ sǝ́ŋ ne tie, wǝ́ ŋ na ka lɔ tiepʊŋpwayǝ we, nyiyǝ we le yee kǝtienaakǝ rǝ tiesǝsǝŋyǝ we le enimiyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Kaa wǝ lǝ wǝǝ, vǝ́ mǝŋ tieyǝ rɛ lǝ sǝ́ŋ no nuŋ, wǝ́ ŋ na ka caa pǝrǝŋpʊŋpwayǝ we, tieyǝ we la yɩɩ vúurǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la pɛɛrɩ alaatiepipǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matewu 19:13-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Enyipǝ pǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ̀ alaatiepipǝ pǝ ŋ pǝ kǝ Yesu ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ ruu pǝ. Paape wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ka ŋ kpaŋ mǝ pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na nyɩŋ wǝ ǝnǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ maa alaatiepipǝ pǝ pǝ mǝ kpǝŋ. Nǝ pǝǝ sǝŋ wǝla gʊŋrǝ nǝ koonu pǝ. Duturǝ ɖi epǝ we pǝ lǝ mǝŋ alaatiepipǝ sa kǝtǝ we, pǝ lǝǝmǝ fɛɛtiiwǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ we mǝrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ, mǝŋ rɛ laa tɛɛnɩ ŋ lɔ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ laatiepirǝ láa tɛɛnɩ tuwǝ kǝtǝ we, yǝ we lǝŋ po ko yulaarǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ ka ŋ lɔ alaatiepipǝ we mǝ ŋ re, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛɛ pǝ la akaakǝ mǝ ŋ pɛɛrɩ pǝ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝ sɩkalǝtǝyǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matewu 19:16-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpii ŋ nóo ko we, wǝ́ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ sùu ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ tùu ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ sʊ̀ʊ ŋ kʊnʊ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝceeceeyǝ, kǝ́ wǝ́ ŋ née yee kǝ ŋ́ nya vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ o lóo pwo mǝ nyiceeceeyǝ wǝ? Nyiceeceeyǝ rɛ lee kpii, we Worokoyǝ ceŋceŋ ko. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />E cii esepǝ we, pǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Paa wʊ nyiyǝ, pee yee kǝtienaakǝ, paa yɩɩ, paa nia a tɛɛ rǝ rɛ, pee yee mǝ rɛ la rɔɔrɔɔwǝ, nuŋ lǝ́ tǝ mǝ lé lee lo tutɛŋwǝ.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Wǝ́ nyiyǝ we ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, ŋ́ née yee otuyǝ sa kpǝlo ǝrǝ mǝ kǝkosopikǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yɩ̀rɩ ŋwǝ mǝ kǝǝtaa mǝ kǝǝtaa, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ lo tuuru lǝ́ tuwǝ rɛ ceŋceŋ e yee, ko e ke siiri ló otulǝmǝyǝ, kǝ ǝ fǝ sɩkayǝ we ǝ sǝpǝ ariariatǝpǝ. Eniyǝ we ǝ lǝ́ǝ lǝmǝ otuyǝ rǝ yulaarǝ, kǝ e pe siimǝ mǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Paa kǝ́ nyiyǝ sa ŋ no nuŋ tuwǝ sa we, wǝ́ wǝ pǝ̀lǝ mǝ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ ŋ ko ŋ ko mǝ tǝlarǝ mǝ tǝlarǝ. Duturǝ ɖi kǝ lǝǝmǝ otuyǝ ŋpa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yɩ̀rɩ no otukarǝtǝpǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kù wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ wǝ lɛnyɩ wǝ koonu epǝ we pǝ lǝǝmǝ pǝla wɛ kǝ pǝ fii Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ we mǝrǝ we!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wǝ́ etieyǝ sa yǝ rili otukarǝtǝpǝ we lo mumuŋ. Paape wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ epipǝ, wǝ lɛnyɩ wǝ koonu anyɩmaasɩpǝ kǝ pǝ fii Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ we mǝrǝ we! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Wǝ yɔlʊ wǝ koonu kpɔŋkɔyǝ kǝ ŋ fii ŋ ka tɛlɩ rǝ nimiwǝ lo ŋuŋrǝ wǝ teeri kǝ́ sɩkalǝtǝyǝ ŋ neh fii Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ we mǝrǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wǝ́ dierǝ we dǝ ge ŋ ri otukarǝtǝpǝ we lo mumuŋ lǝ ŋ kʊla rǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «We ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru anya alɔkuŋkǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yɩ̀rɩ pǝ pʊrɩpʊrɩ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ lǝŋ koru tuwǝ sa le eyee, paa ŋkǝ Worokoyǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ lóo koru tu ri ŋ tu le eyee.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ yili ŋ ke ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A lǝŋ nyɩŋ, ŋlǝ paa yǝ la maa tu ri ŋ tu yǝ lo co wǝ́ yǝ lé siimǝ lǝ́.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, mǝŋ rɛ la pwɛyɩ la maa na nyarǝwǝ, na apaanʊpǝ, na apaatɛpǝ, ne leeyǝ, nǝ tǝyǝ, ne epipǝ mǝ nǝ ǝkǝtǝǝyǝ rǝ ŋlǝ mǝ Dieceeceerǝ we lo yurǝ we, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />yǝ we láa lɔ wǝ lo wǝtoomwarakpǝ pǝrǝŋwǝ kǝtuuru rǝ rǝkǝsa le eniyǝ sa mǝrǝ. Pǝ lóo koonu na anyarǝyǝ, apaanʊpǝ, apaatɛpǝ, eleepǝ, epipǝ mǝ ǝkǝtǝǝyǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ acʊcʊʊrʊpiyǝ. Paa lah pa nya vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ rǝ soosowǝ sa wǝ lo furu wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kǝto enyisǝsǝŋpǝ wa pǝ leh pe ri ǝtǝtǝǝlǝpǝ, kǝ enyitǝtǝǝlǝpǝ pǝ pe ri ǝsǝsǝŋpǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lǝ tǝ la wɛɛlɩ kǝtatǝkǝ lo ru rǝ nǝ ǝkpǝ́kǝ mǝ na asaanǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matewu 20:17-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu mǝ epǝ we pǝ ke siimǝ ŋwǝ pǝ sanǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko Yerusalɛmǝ. Yesu ŋ ko conu wǝ. Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ cɩ̀ɩlɩ. Wǝ́ vurǝ vìi epǝ we pǝ ke siimǝ pǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ pɔ̀rʊ ne enyikpiipǝ we pǝlǝ tǝ mǝ eyi, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ tuwǝ we wǝ loh ko wǝ kǝ pǝ wǝ tuu ŋwǝ ŋ ke ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />«Nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ, yǝ loh ko Yerusalɛmǝ, kǝ pǝ kǝ fǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi pǝ kpii otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ rǝ akaakǝ. Pǝ lah ka tɔɔ na gbɛŋpɔrǝ kǝ pǝ fǝ ŋwǝ pǝ kpii epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ rǝ akaakǝ, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />kǝ pǝ mɔɔnʊ ŋwǝ, kǝ pǝ toopǝ otutomiyǝ pǝ fieni ŋwǝ, kǝ pǝ lɛ pǝ culu ŋwǝ mǝ fwɛɛpǝlawǝ, kǝ pǝ wʊ ŋwǝ. Paa kǝ ŋ saanǝ ŋ ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ rǝ juuta la kǝmaakǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu lo tuwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matewu 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Zebede lǝ ǝpǝrǝŋpipǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ pǝ rùu pǝ kǝ̀lǝ mǝ Yesu wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, yǝ lǝh pǝ́ lǝ́ tǝrɛ, kǝ a tɛɛnɩ e yee wǝ o koonu lǝ oo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ́ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee ŋ́ koonu nǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ e le pe ke fii lá wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, dɔɔkpɛ kǝ a maa leh ceŋceŋ ŋ tii rǝ lé kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ, kǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ tii rǝ lá kǝpɛŋsiɛɛkǝ oo». <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nyee ci tuwǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. Nǝ nyóo koru atɛɛnɩ pǝ ŋʊʊnʊ nǝ acʊcʊʊrʊpiyǝ sa pǝ lah ŋʊʊnʊ mǝ wǝ? Amaa nǝ nyóo koru ewii acʊcʊʊrʊpiyǝ la mɛŋwǝ we pǝ leh wiiri mǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ lóo koru». Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Awo, nǝ nyáa tɛɛnɩ pǝ ŋʊʊnʊ nǝ acʊcʊʊrʊpiyǝ we pǝ lah ŋʊʊnʊ mǝ, kǝ nǝ wii acʊcʊʊrʊpiyǝ la mɛŋwǝ ŋ́ neh wii wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Paa ŋkǝ ŋmǝ ŋ́ náa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ yǝ ǝnǝ pe tii rǝ mǝ kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ amaa mǝ kǝpɛŋsiɛɛkǝ. Afɛɛtiiyǝ sa we, yǝ ri rǝ epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na kpaka yǝ ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ la anɛŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Kǝ́ enyikpiituturupǝ we pǝlǝ tǝ pǝ lo nuŋ dierǝ sa we, wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ pǝ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwò pǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ cii, epǝ we pǝ ri ǝkǝŋyǝ le epilipǝ we, pǝ lée si pǝlǝ ǝkǝŋyǝ le enyipǝ pǝ ŋ maarǝ. Wǝ́ omumuŋpǝ rǝ gǝŋrǝ we pǝ la nya okopiyǝ rǝ otuturupǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ŋnǝ paa we, wǝ pǝǝ lǝ ǝnǝ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ. Paa mǝŋ rɛ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ ri mumuŋyǝ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ we, yǝ we ŋ ri nǝ sʊmatǝyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ rɛ ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ ri sǝsǝŋyǝ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ we, we yǝ we ŋ ri nǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ la sʊmatǝyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Duturǝ ɖi Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi lǝ pǝ ŋkǝ kǝ pǝ pa sʊma ŋwǝ rǝ, paa lǝ pǝ ŋ pa sʊma enyipǝ, kǝ ŋ fǝ na vɔrʊrǝ ŋ koonu, kǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ lɔ ŋ koonu enyipǝ wa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca laanyɩŋtǝyǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Barǝtimewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matewu 20:29-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ fìi Yeriko. Wǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ rǝ Yeriko pǝ ko ŋ ko. Anyɩŋ Timewo le pi, laanyɩŋtǝyǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Barǝtimewo tini rǝ kʊŋlɛɛrɩwǝ láa rialǝ otuyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Kǝ́ ŋ na nya ŋ no nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Nazarɛtǝtǝ Yesu ŋ nǝ pǝ ŋ náa tɛlɩ we, wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ko ŋ woolu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yesu, Davidǝ le Pilepi, nyɩŋ mǝ tǝlarǝwǝ oo!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ kpaŋ mǝ ŋwǝ kǝ ŋ rǝŋ. Paape wǝ́ ŋ ci ǝtǝ ŋ yà ŋ ko ŋ woolu ŋpa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Davidǝ le pilepi, nyɩŋ mǝ tǝlarǝwǝ oo!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tùmǝ ŋ yàa, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pwo ŋwǝ ŋ pǝ.» Wǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ pwò ŋwǝ pǝ tìi ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyɩɩ, kǝ e yi, ya lóo pwo lǝ́.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Kǝ́ ŋ na pɔrʊ na kǝkpakpurumukǝ ŋ no co we, wǝ́ ŋ yili ŋ yàa kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ. Wǝ́ ŋ sanǝ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ wǝ́ a ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee ŋ́ koonu lǝ́?» Wǝ́ laanyɩŋtǝyǝ we ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ tǝ mǝ ŋ nyɩŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ ko, lá lɔnuŋrǝ la pɔrʊ lǝ́.» Rǝ kǝyaakǝ we, wǝ́ laanyɩŋtǝyǝ we ŋ tǝ ŋ ka ŋ nyɩŋ. Wǝ́ ŋ sìimǝ Yesu ŋ ko ŋ ko rǝ gʊŋrǝ we.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu leh fii Yerusalɛmǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matewu 21:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yowanɛsɩ 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Kǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ lǝ pǝ kǝlǝ mǝ Yerusalɛmǝ, rǝ Befage mǝ Betania la kǝlɛɛrɩkǝ, rǝ kǝ́ o loh ko rǝ oliviepǝ lo dutupirǝ we we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ eyi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ mǝ ko dǝŋtǝǝpirǝ sa yaa rǝ nǝ kǝnyɩŋkǝ. Vǝ́ nǝ nyée ke fii kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ we, nǝ nyáa nyɩŋ pǝ la kɔŋ rookɛtɛpirǝ rɛ. Rɛ faa rɛ ŋ tii rǝ rǝ ŋ nyɩŋ, kǝ nǝ wuru rǝ nǝ po koonu mǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ rɛ lǝ pǝ́ nǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee tuwǝ sa ǝnǝ we?” Nǝ tíi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Kulǝtǝyǝ ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ rǝ. Paa láa siɛnɩ mǝ rǝ ŋ pǝ rǝkǝsarǝkǝsa.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ ko ŋ ko. Wǝ́ pǝ kolu pǝ nyɩnɩ ɖookɛtɛpirǝ we gɔnʊ rǝ koruwǝ rǝ nyarǝwǝ rɛ lo guŋpolurǝ rǝ kʊŋlɛɛrɩwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ wùru rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ rɛ pǝ ka yaa rǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee ǝnǝ? Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyóo wuru ɖookɛtɛpirǝ we wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ tìi pǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ màa pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ fǝ ɖookɛtɛpirǝ we pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kòonu Yesu. Wǝ́ pǝ pɔrʊ pǝla wǝkpakpǝ pǝ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ ɖookɛtɛpirǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ rɛ̀ ŋ kolu ŋ tini. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ fǝ̀ pǝla wǝkpakpǝ pǝ cò gʊŋrǝ we, arɛɛpǝ eweyǝ we pǝ lǝ sǝ rǝ bɔɔrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ ko conu mǝ epǝ we pǝ kǝ tǝǝlǝ pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ woolu pǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ lǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ! Worokoyǝ ŋ pɛɛrɩ nyiyǝ sa ŋ no furu rǝ na nyɩŋrǝ wǝ! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Worokoyǝ ŋ pɛɛrɩ lǝh tǝtǝ Davidǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ sa wǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ wǝ. Ǝkǝkǝ kǝ pǝ kǝ koonu Worokoyǝ rǝ yulaarǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu ŋ fìi Yerusalɛmǝ, wǝ́ ŋ kolu Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ cò nimirǝ ŋ yɩ̀rɩ tu ri ŋ tu ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kù. Kǝ́ wǝ ke ŋ yee ariɔniyǝ kǝto we, wǝ́ ŋ rù ŋ ko ŋ ko Betania ŋpǝ mǝ enyikpiipǝ we pǝlǝ tǝ mǝ eyi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la fwɛɛrɩ wǝcookpǝ rɛ wǝ lǝŋ nyɩŋ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matewu 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Gaalǝǝrǝkǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ pwɛyɩ rǝ Betania. Anyɩŋ kǝtɛŋkǝ kǝ ya kǝ láa wʊ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ wǝcookpǝ rɛ mǝ eweyǝ ŋ manǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ sanǝ ŋ kolu ŋ yɩ̀rɩ mǝ ŋ náa nya ǝtǝnǝyǝ wǝ. Paape kǝ́ ŋ ne ke fii we, laa nya tǝrɛ, eweyǝ sɔŋ yǝ ka tɛɛ. Duturǝ ɖi ŋkǝ eniyǝ wǝcookpǝ wǝ láa nyɩŋ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi wǝciikpǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rɛ lǝŋ tǝ ŋ pe ri lǝ́ ǝtǝnǝyǝ ŋ nyɩŋ kʊrakʊra.» Wǝ́ no otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ nunu wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu le piri otusiiritǝpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matewu 21:12-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yowanɛsɩ 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ fìi Yerusalɛmǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kolu ŋ fìi Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ke ŋ piri epǝ we pǝ yà pǝ ke ŋ siiri otuyǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ fuu otuyǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ rè epǝ we pǝ láa nyaa sɩkayǝ la akpǝlɔpǝ ŋ cò. Wǝ́ ŋ lɛ̀ ŋ rè epǝ we pǝ ya pǝ lée siiri otookpapǝ la asaayǝ ŋ cò. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Laa ka ŋ maa rɛ ŋ re otusiiriyǝ ŋ saŋ ŋ pa tɛlɩ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ kaŋ pǝ lo otuyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋkǝ Worokoŋtierǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Pǝ loh mǝ pwo mǝ nyarǝwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ wǝkpǝŋkpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ la fɛɛmwɛŋnyuŋkpǝ? Wǝ́ ŋnǝ paa nǝ nyǝ fǝ wǝ nǝ nye yee ayɩlayɩtǝpǝ la fɛɛŋwaawǝ.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ nunu tuwǝ sa, wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ taa kʊŋwǝ kǝ pǝ wʊ ŋwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ suu no vurǝ mǝ kǝ́ nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ ka ŋ taa no otukaŋyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ kǝto. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kǝ́ ɖiɔrǝ lo ro we, wǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ rù rǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la kaŋ otuyǝ lo ru rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ mǝ nyuŋmwɛŋwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matewu 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo ko ru pǝ lah tɛlɩ mǝ ɖokoŋpirǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ kǝ́ wǝcookpǝ we wǝ la kpaa ka sʊʊ ǝrǝ okuruŋkuyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tàalǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, yɩrɩ re, wǝcookpǝ we a la fwɛɛrɩ wǝ la kpaa kpǝlo.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ lɔ Worokoyǝ nǝ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we: “Mǝŋ rɛ le tíi dutupirǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: Nuru a cɛ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we kǝ a ka tɔɔ rǝ apʊyǝ mǝrǝ. Wǝ́ yǝ we ŋ nǝǝ tǝmǝlǝ rǝ na ziɔŋrǝ, paa wǝ́ ŋ na lɔ ŋ no nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ tuwǝ we ŋ ya ŋ náa tɛŋ wǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ we, wǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ wǝ koonu yǝ we mǝŋkɔɔwe.” <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kǝto ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tu ri ŋ tu nǝ nyáa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ nǝ pǝ́ we, nǝ lɔ nǝ nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ wǝ la marǝ ǝpǝ wǝ lo koonu nǝ, eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ wǝ ŋ koonu nǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Vǝ́ nǝ nye yi nǝ nya yaa nǝ nyah mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ, wǝ́ mǝŋ dierǝ rɛ gbii rǝ ŋnǝ mǝ nyiyǝ rɛ lǝ mǝrǝ we, nǝ fǝ nǝ cɛɛ yǝ we, kǝ nǝ Tǝyǝ we ŋ kpii rǝ yulaarǝ ŋ fǝ ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ nǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ nǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Paa mǝŋ nǝ nyǝǝ fǝ nǝ cɛɛ nǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ we, nǝ Tǝyǝ we ŋ kpii rǝ yulaarǝ lǝŋ fǝ nǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ we nǝ nyée yee ŋ cɛɛ nǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu le dierǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ no okopiyǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matewu 21:23-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ tǝ pǝ sìɛnɩ pǝ pǝlǝ Yerusalɛmǝ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ saŋ mǝ ŋ ko mǝ ŋ pǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ we mǝrǝ. Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tùu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ lo okopi wǝ́ a la nya a ya e lée yee otuyǝ sa ǝnǝ? Amaa ǝlǝ ŋ no koonu lǝ́ okopiyǝ e yee yǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ nǝ dierǝ jeŋceŋ, mǝŋ nǝ nyo koonu mǝ kpǝkpǝlǝŋkuŋwǝ we, ŋ́ née tíi nǝ okopiyǝ le eyǝ we ŋ́ nǝ fǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee otuyǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nǝ tíi mǝ, Yowanɛsɩ lo worokomɛŋwiiriwǝ we wǝǝ, wǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kpǝŋ amaa anyɩmaasɩpǝ lǝ kpǝŋ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ ŋwaa pǝ ŋ tíi awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ yǝ la tɛŋ “Worokoyǝ” we, lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ lǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ nyaa lɔ Yowanɛsɩ nǝ nuŋ wǝ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />We yǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ wǝ lo ru rǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ lǝ kpǝŋ?» Pǝ ya pǝ ko ŋ suu nyikpǝŋwǝ we lo vurǝ, duturǝ ɖi pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lɔ̀ pǝ nunu ǝkǝnǝŋ Yowanɛsɩ ke ri worokokpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝyǝ kǝceece. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Wǝ́ pǝ tìi Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ lee ci». Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋmǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ́ nǝŋ tíi nǝ okopiyǝ we ŋ́ nǝ fǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee otuyǝ sa wǝ».<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca duturǝ lo ru rǝ apaalǝtǝpǝ rɛ pǝ lɛnyɩ yurǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matewu 21:33-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ ka ŋ wɛɛlɩ mǝ ŋ ca otutuyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyiyǝ rɛ kpɛnɩ arɛzɛŋtɛɛkǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tɔ̀ kɩlɩkpayǝ ŋ kpìi atɛɛkǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ nyini fɛɛmʊʊrʊrɛzɛŋyǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tɔ̀ wǝkukpǝ pǝ leh mǝ tii pǝ ŋ rǝŋ atɛɛkǝ sa wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ atɛɛkǝ sa ŋ kpìi apaalǝtǝpǝ rǝ akaakǝ, wǝ́ ŋ pwɛ̀yɩ ŋ ko ŋ ko gʊŋrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Kǝ́ eniŋlɛɛyǝ yǝ lo ro we, wǝ́ ŋ kpìi sʊmatǝyǝ rɛ ŋ manǝ apaalǝtǝpǝ we, kǝ ŋ ka lɔ na nɛŋ rɛzɛŋyǝ ŋ po koonu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wǝ́ apaalǝtǝpǝ we pǝ lɔ̀ sʊmatǝyǝ we pǝ cùlu, wǝ́ pǝ pìri ŋwǝ ŋ ko ŋ ko akaakpaakpa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Wǝ́ tɛɛlǝtǝyǝ we ŋ tǝ ŋ kpìi sʊmatǝpʊŋpwayǝ ŋ manǝ pǝ. Wǝ́ ŋwǝ yǝ ǝnǝ pǝ nyàanǝ ŋwǝ rǝ yurǝ, wǝ́ pǝ fɛ̀ɛpɩ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ kpìi tatǝyǝ ŋ manǝ, wǝ́ pǝ wʊlʊ ŋwǝ yǝ. Epǝ we ŋ tǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kpìi rǝ wǝla kǝmaakǝ we, pǝ cùlu arɛɛpǝ wa, wǝ́ pǝ wʊlʊ arɛɛpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ne piyǝ we ŋ náa taa kǝǝwǝ ceŋceŋ ko ŋ kolu ŋ tuuru ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kpìi ŋwǝ ŋ manǝ pǝ ŋ tǝ̀ǝlǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Pǝ loh ko suu mǝ pi le enimiyǝ!” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Paa wǝ́ apaalǝtǝpǝ sa pǝ ke ŋ tíi awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Nyiyǝ sa ŋ nǝh pǝ ŋ pe ri ǝtǝtuyǝ sa wǝ! Nǝ pǝ kǝ la wʊ ŋwǝ, kǝ ǝtǝtuyǝ we yǝ siɛrɩ yǝ yee lah anɛŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Wǝ́ pǝ lɔ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ wʊlʊ. Wǝ́ pǝ rù mǝ ŋwǝ rǝ arɛzɛŋtɛɛkǝ we pǝ tìe pǝ cò. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Rǝkǝsa kǝ́ wǝ́ tɛɛlǝtǝyǝ we ŋ neh pe yee? Lǝ́ǝ pǝ ŋ pa wʊʊlʊ apaalǝtǝpǝ sa, kǝ ŋ fǝ arɛzɛŋtɛɛkǝ sa ŋ kpii apaalǝtǝpʊŋpwapǝ rǝ akaakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mǝŋkǝ nǝ nyǝ kǝ dierǝ sa pǝ la ŋʊrʊ rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ɖurǝ we okumarǝtǝpǝ pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ pǝ lo co we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">ŋrǝ le pe yee yusirurǝ wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ǝtǝ Woroko ŋ ne yee wǝ ǝnǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">Kǝ́ lo tucovurǝ wǝ́ yǝ láa nyɩŋ ǝnǝ!”» <figure style="fig" alt="Une vigne dans la clôture avec un pressoir et une tour de garde" file="lb00103c.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass" ref="12:1">Arɛzɛŋtɛɛkǝ mǝ kǝla kɩlɩkpayǝ mǝ fɛɛmʊʊrʊrɛzɛŋyǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ fɛɛtiirǝŋatɛɛkǝ</figure><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ pǝ lɔ Yesu, duturǝ ɖi pǝ ke cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋpǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ na ca duturǝ we. Paape pǝ ko ŋ suu kǝkpǝŋkǝ we lo vurǝ, wǝ́ pǝ màa ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ pǝ ko ŋ ko.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu le dierǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ laŋpooyǝ la amwarakǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matewu 22:15-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Pǝ kpìi Afarisitǝpǝ rɛ mǝ Erodɛsɩ la wǝcakukpǝ le enyipǝ rɛ rǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ kǝ pǝ kǝ pǝ́ ne dierǝ pǝ kɔŋ kpɛrɛwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ a láa tɛŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ. Wǝ́ a lǝŋ maa rɛ ŋ cɩɩlɩ lǝ́. Duturǝ ɖi a lǝŋ yɩrɩ rǝ anyɩŋkǝ, paa Worokoyǝ la akʊŋyǝ wǝ́ a láa kaŋ mǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ. Wǝ kaamǝ kǝ pǝ mwara Kayizaro la laŋpooyǝ, ǝŋ amaa ow? Wǝ kpii kǝ la mwara amaa rɛ ŋ paa mwara?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Paape wǝ́ Yesu ŋ nyɩnɩ pǝla alakpayǝ ŋ cìi, wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kɔŋ mǝ kpɛrɛwǝ wǝ? Nǝ fǝ sɩkakpotokpotoyǝ rɛ ceŋceŋ nǝ pǝ ŋ́ yɩrɩ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ sɩkayǝ we ceŋceŋ pǝ kòonu ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝlǝ la anyɩŋkǝ mǝ nyɩŋrǝ yǝ tɛɛ rǝ sɩkayǝ sa ǝnǝ?» Wǝ́ pǝ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kayizaro ŋ lǝǝwe». <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «We nǝ fǝ otuyǝ we yǝ ri Kayizaro la anɛŋyǝ nǝ koonu Kayizaro, kǝ nǝ fǝ Worokoyǝ lo otuyǝ nǝ koonu Worokoyǝ.» Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ pǝ kpǝ̀ pǝ yàa pǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ ŋwǝ rǝ.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ pǝ́ Yesu le dierǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ la asaanǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matewu 22:23-33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:27-38">Luka 20:27-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Asadukitǝpǝ rɛ pǝ pǝlǝ Yesu lǝ kpǝŋ. Ŋpǝ pǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ enyiǝtǝpǝ pǝ lǝŋ pa saanǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu le dierǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Tukaŋtǝyǝ, Mose la ŋʊrʊ le kpii lǝ rǝ seyǝ la kǝfwɛɛkǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ lǝǝmǝ mǝteeyǝ ŋ na lɔ tieyǝ, pǝ lǝǝ mǝ, wǝ́ pǝrǝŋyǝ we ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ ŋ na maa tieyǝ we, nyiyǝ sa lǝ́ǝ fǝ kpeetieyǝ we ŋ lɔ, kǝ ŋ tǝnǝ yuwǝ ŋ koonu yǝ we ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ wǝ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Rǝkǝsa apaanʊpǝ rɛ apǝrɩmata pǝ ke kpii. Wǝ́ pǝlo mumuŋyǝ we ŋ lɔ̀ tieyǝ. Pǝ lǝǝ mǝ, wǝ́ pǝrǝŋyǝ we ŋ kpǝ̀. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Wǝ́ paanʊyitǝyǝ we ŋ fǝ̀ kpeetieyǝ we ŋ lɔ̀, pǝ lǝǝ mǝ, wǝ́ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ kpǝ̀. Tatǝyǝ we ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ mǝŋ kaa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Wǝ́ apaanʊpǝ sa pǝla apǝrɩmata pǝ lǝǝ mǝ piyǝ wǝ́ pǝ kpǝ̀. Kǝ́ pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lǝ kpǝ́ we, wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ tieyǝ we ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ kpǝ́. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Kǝ́ wǝ ri pǝla apǝrɩmata pǝ la lɔ tieyǝ sa wǝǝ, vǝ́ enyiǝtǝpǝ pǝ la pa saanǝ wǝǝ, tieyǝ sa leh pe ri pǝlǝ ǝlǝ le tieyǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋkǝ kǝ́ nǝ nyee ci mǝŋ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ we, mǝŋ Worokoyǝ lo okopiyǝ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ tǝǝnǝ nǝ wɛ ǝnǝ? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Duturǝ ɖi vǝ́ enyiǝtǝpǝ pǝ la pa saanǝ we, pǝ lǝŋ tǝ pǝ pa lɔ tieyǝ amaa pǝ lǝŋ tǝ pǝ pa caa wǝnuŋkpǝ. Paa pǝ lǝ́ǝ lǝ mǝŋ epicoŋpipǝ rǝ yulaarǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ la asaanǝkǝ la kǝtakǝ wǝǝ, nǝ fǝǝ kǝ nǝ nyɩŋ rǝ Mose la kǝfwɛɛkǝ, rǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ la wɛɛlɩ pǝ lo ru rǝ goŋkupirǝ we ga ŋ ta naawǝ? Worokoyǝ tìi Mose rǝ fɛɛwǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Ŋmǝ ŋ́ ri Abǝrahamǝ lo Worokoyǝ, Isakǝ lo Worokoyǝ mǝ Yakɔbǝ lo Worokoyǝ.”» <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Worokoyǝ lee ri enyiǝtǝpǝ lo Worokoyǝ, paa ri epǝ we pǝ kpii vɔrʊrǝ lo Worokoyǝ. Nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ tǝǝnǝ nǝ wɛ fee.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esepǝ kpǝlo lǝ sǝsǝŋyǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matewu 22:34-40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Sekaŋtǝyǝ rɛ nunu kǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛɛrɩ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu la pɔrʊ dierǝ we lo duturǝ le tíi Asadukitǝpǝ sɩsiɛrɩ. Wǝ́ sekaŋtǝyǝ sa ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝ esepǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lǝ mǝrǝ wǝǝ, seyǝ rǝ fǝŋ ŋ ri sǝsǝŋyǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ nuŋ, Isǝrayɛlǝ, sesǝsǝŋyǝ ŋ kaamǝ: “Ǝtǝ Woroko, loh Worokoyǝ ceŋceŋ ko ŋ ri Worokoyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />A lah mǝ taa Ǝtǝ Woroko, ló Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝ lá ziɔŋrǝ kpǝlo, ló kǝrukǝ kpǝlo, ló otuciyǝ kpǝlo mǝ ló okopiyǝ kpǝlo”. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Seyitǝyǝ we ŋ kaamǝ: “A lah mǝ taa lá kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝŋ ŋlǝ́ŋlǝ́ la wɛ kǝtǝ.” Seyǝ rɛ lǝǝ tǝ ŋ kpii ŋ naanǝ ŋ teeri ǝpǝ eyipǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Wǝ́ sekaŋtǝyǝ we ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ponu, Tukaŋtǝyǝ. A la tɛŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Ǝtǝ Woroko ceŋceŋ ko ŋ ri Worokoyǝ, rɛ lǝǝ tǝ ŋ kpii ŋ kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Kǝ la lɛ la taa nǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝ lah ziɔŋrǝ kpǝlo, loh otuciyǝ kpǝlo mǝ loh okopiyǝ kpǝlo, kǝ la lɛ la taa lah kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝŋ ŋlǝŋlǝ lah wɛ lǝ kǝǝwǝ kǝtǝ. Wǝ ponu wǝ teeri kǝ a lah wʊ akɛɛpǝ o tu naa o toolu o koonu Worokoyǝ wǝ, mǝ otupʊŋpwayǝ we pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ pǝ ŋ toolu pǝ ŋ koonu Worokoyǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na nyɩŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ sekaŋtǝyǝ sa la pɔrʊ dierǝ sa la tɛŋ mǝ otuciyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝ lǝǝ lǝǝrǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ.» Wǝla kǝmaakǝ we rɛ lǝǝ tǝ ŋ tu turuwǝ ŋ pǝ́ ne dierǝ rɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesiyayǝ ri Davidǝ lo Kulǝtǝyǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matewu 22:41-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu yà ka ŋ kaŋ otuyǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ dierǝ sa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nɛ kǝto wǝ́ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ lóo koru atɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Mesiyayǝ we ri Davidǝ le pilepiyǝ wǝ? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Saŋ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ wǝ́ Davidǝ ŋwǝŋwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Ǝtǝ Woroko le tíi mǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Pe tii rǝ mǝ kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Ko ro eniyǝ we ŋ́ nǝ fǝ lǝ́ ǝkǝǝkpǝlǝtǝpǝ ŋ́ kpii lǝ́ rǝ lá akparǝyǝ lǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Davidǝ ŋwǝŋwǝ lóo pwo ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: Kulǝtǝyǝ. Wǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ ŋ pe ri Davidǝ le pilepiyǝ wǝ?» Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ we wǝ yà wǝ ko ŋ nuŋ ŋwǝ mǝ faawǝ.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu le ci la kaŋ enyipǝ lo ru rǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matewu 23:1-36</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ ya ŋ náa kaŋ otuyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ yee yurǝ rǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Pǝ láa taa pǝ ŋ kpii wǝkpakpurumukpǝ pǝ ŋ siri pǝ ŋ tɛlɩ. Wǝ́ pǝ láa taa enyipǝ pǝ ŋ pɛɛlɩ pǝ ŋ ceeni pǝ rǝ acanɩtiyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Pǝ láa taa pǝ ŋ tii rǝ omumuŋpǝ la afɛɛtiiyǝ rǝ okumwɛŋnyuŋyǝ mǝ afɛɛtiiriyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ŋpǝ pǝ lée sisi ekpeetiepǝ pǝ ŋ lɔ pǝlo otuyǝ kɩɩkɩ. Pǝ kah ya pǝ ŋ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ, o lóo ko ǝrǝ fǝŋ, kǝ ǝ pǝ, pǝ faa lɛ. Pǝ láa kʊrʊ pǝ ŋ yee wǝ pǝ ŋ kaŋ enyipǝ kǝ pǝ nyɩŋ pǝ. Worokoyǝ lah pa ta pǝlo kǝtukoŋkǝ ŋpa ŋ teeri enyituturupǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lǝ kǝ kpeetieyǝ rɛ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu ke tini rǝ tukpiisɩkayǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ kǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ ya pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ pǝ ŋ kpii sɩkayǝ wǝ. Asɩkalǝtǝpǝ wa pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ pǝ ŋ kpii sɩkayǝ ŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Wǝ́ riariatǝkpeetieyǝ rɛ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ kpìi sɩkakpotokpotoyǝ rɛ yi ŋ naa lɔ okuruyǝ kpaa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pwò no otukarǝtǝpǝ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, riariatǝkpeetieyǝ sa le kpii sɩkayǝ le teeri nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ ne pe kpii sɩkayǝ rǝ tukpiisɩkayǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Duturǝ ɖi enyituturupǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ le pe kpii sɩkayǝ we ŋ no to pǝ ŋ no turu wǝ. Ŋwǝ paa we, mǝŋ na ariaayǝ yǝ re ŋwǝ we, lǝ fǝ tuwǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ lo tuuru ŋwǝ kǝ ŋ tii vɔrʊrǝ le pe kpii.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la tɛŋ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ la awɔɔkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-3">Matewu 24:1-3</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Rǝkǝsa kǝ́ Yesu ŋ no ru rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ ŋ nóo ko we, wǝ́ no tukarǝtǝyǝ rɛ ceŋceŋ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ, yɩrɩ orukpatɩyǝ rɛ re! Kǝ́ la nyarǝmumuŋwǝ wǝǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A la nyɩŋ nyarǝmumuŋwǝ sa, jirǝ rɛ gbii lǝ́ǝ pǝ ɖurǝ rɛ mǝŋ jeŋceŋ lǝŋ po tuuru dɛɛ rǝ ɖupʊŋpwarǝ rɛ. Pǝ lée re yǝ pǝ co kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuyǝ we yǝ lo furu yǝ pǝ pǝ, vǝ́ ǝrǝkǝ kǝ lah lɛ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matewu 24:3-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu kolu tini rǝ oliviepǝ lo dutupirǝ. Dutupirǝ sa láa nyɩnɩ lǝ ŋ maŋ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ. Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro, Yakubu, Yowanɛsɩ mǝ Aŋdǝre ŋpǝ sɔŋ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tùu Yesu, wǝ́ pǝ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Tíi lǝ, eniyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ otuyǝ sa kpǝlo yǝ lǝh pǝ wǝ? Kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ la nyɩŋ le ci ǝkǝnǝŋ otuyǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le eniyǝ yǝ lo ro wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ yìili ŋ ke ŋ tíi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ yee yurǝ, rɛ ŋ pǝǝ tǝǝnǝ nǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Enyipǝ wa pǝ loh po ru kǝ pǝ fǝ mǝ nyɩŋrǝ pǝ kpii pǝla wɛ. Kǝ yǝ mǝ yǝ mǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ “Ŋmǝ ŋ́ ri Mesiyayǝ we”, kǝ pǝ tǝǝnǝ enyipǝ wa. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Vǝ́ nǝ nyoh po nuŋ akɔŋkǝ kǝ ya kǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ, amaa pǝ ya pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ pǝ ŋ ru rǝ akɔŋkǝ rɛ kǝ lǝh pǝ we, turuwǝ wǝ paa nyaa nǝ mɛŋwǝ. Wǝ kpii kǝ tuwǝ sa wǝ pǝ ǝnǝ. Paa wǝ lǝŋ maa wǝ ri ǝrǝkǝ sa la alɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ǝkǝŋyǝ yǝ leh pe yi yǝ tɛɛ rǝ awɛ. Epilipǝ pǝ leh pe yi pǝ tɛɛ rǝ awɛ. Kǝtǝǝwǝ wǝ leh mǝ tikili rǝ afɛɛ mǝ afɛɛyǝ. Kǝtɛŋkǝ kǝ loh po ru rǝ afɛɛ mǝ afɛɛyǝ. Wǝ lǝ́ǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ kuluretǝyǝ ŋ ne tie oroonukǝ lo vuurǝ kǝtǝ.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Ŋnǝ we, nǝ yee yurǝ, duturǝ ɖi pǝ lǝh pǝ fǝ nǝ pǝ ko fɛɛtɛŋakpaŋyǝ, kǝ pǝ culu nǝ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ lo okumwɛŋnyuŋyǝ. Ŋmǝ kǝto pǝ lǝh pǝ fǝ nǝ pǝ ko ǝkǝŋyɩrɩtǝpǝ mǝ epilipǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Eniyǝ we kǝ nǝ nya fɛɛ nǝ ri ɖaŋsieyǝ nǝ ru rǝ mǝ nǝ tíi pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Duturǝ ɖi wǝ kaamǝ kǝ wǝkpǝŋkpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ nuŋ Dieceeceerǝ sa kpɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Vǝ́ pǝ la lɔ nǝ pǝ lo ko mǝ rǝ fɛɛtɛŋakpaŋyǝ we, nǝ pǝǝ kǝǝnǝ nǝ coonu ru rǝ dierǝ we nǝ nyah ka tɛŋ wǝ. Paa dierǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ née tíi nǝ mǝ eniyǝ we we, nǝ tɛŋ rǝ. Duturǝ ɖi ŋkǝ ŋnǝ nǝ nyah ka wɛɛlɩ, paa Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Paanʊyǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ ŋwǝŋwǝ na paanʊyǝ ŋ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ kǝ pǝ wʊ ŋwǝ, kǝ tǝyǝ ŋ fǝ ne piyǝ ŋ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ pǝ wʊ. Epipǝ pǝ lée yi pǝ tɛɛ rǝ pǝlǝ ǝtǝpǝ mǝ pǝle eleepǝ kǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ pǝ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ pǝ wʊ. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ŋmǝ kǝto enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lǝ́ǝ kpǝlǝ nǝ kǝǝwǝ. Paape yǝ we ŋ náa tɔ ŋ yaa ǝrǝ alɛɛkǝ we, yǝ we láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arianyɩŋmumuŋyǝ le eniyǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matewu 24:15-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Vǝ́ nǝ nya pa nyɩŋ tuwǝ we wǝ laa laka eyeekǝ wǝ la pa lɔ kǝtiikǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ we, yǝ we ŋ ya ŋ nǝ́ǝ kǝ otuyǝ sa ŋ nuŋ yǝlo duturǝ. Eniyǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ we, epǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ Yudeya pǝ suu pǝ ŋ ko otutupiyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yǝ we ŋ tɛɛ rǝ akpanyaŋkǝ we, ŋ paa sʊʊ ŋ fii gukpǝ ŋ kǝ fǝ tǝrɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yǝ we ŋ kpii rǝ atɛɛkǝ we, ŋ paa siɛnɩ ŋ pǝ nyarǝwǝ ŋ pǝ fǝ na kǝkpakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Okuluretǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ re epipǝ pǝ láa mɛɛnɩ rǝ ŋyǝ eciyǝ we mǝrǝ we, pǝla paapɔ mǝ pǝla aria! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Nǝ mǝ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ kǝ otuyǝ sa yǝ pǝǝ pǝ mǝ asiɛniyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Duturǝ ɖi rǝ ŋyǝ eniyǝ we mǝrǝ we, enyipǝ pǝ láa cʊʊrʊ ŋpa wǝlǝ kǝtǝŋkǝ wǝ lee kpii ru ǝrǝ ǝrǝkǝ le kǝtiekǝ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ còo tu ri ŋ tu wǝ, po ro ruŋruŋ. Wǝlǝ kǝtǝŋkǝ wǝ lǝŋ pa lɛ wǝ kpii kʊrakʊra. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mǝŋ ŋkǝ kǝ́ Ǝtǝ Woroko ŋ nǝ sǝ eciyǝ we ŋ nǝ sǝǝlǝ rǝ we, rɛ ri ŋ rɛ lǝŋ ko tuuru ŋ tii vɔrʊrǝ. Paa rǝ epǝ we ŋ na saa ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ kǝto we, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ sǝ eciyǝ we ŋ nǝ sǝǝlǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Kǝto mǝŋ rɛ le pe tíi nǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Nǝ yɩrɩ re, Mesiyayǝ we kpii rǝ ɖǝǝnǝ!” amaa nǝ yɩrɩ re, “Kpii rǝ ɖeeni!” we, nǝ paa lɔ yǝ we nǝ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Duturǝ ɖi anianiatǝmesiyapǝ mǝ anianiatǝkpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ pǝ loh po ru. Pǝ leh mǝ yee otulaanyɩŋtǝnǝyǝ mǝ otucovurǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ tǝǝnǝ enyipǝ. Mǝŋ pǝ koh mǝ koru kʊraa kǝ pǝ tǝǝnǝ mǝŋ epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na saa ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kǝto nǝ yee yurǝ, ŋ́ ne tíi nǝ tu ri ŋ tu ŋ́ no coonu ŋ́ na lɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi lǝ ǝpǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matewu 24:29-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Rǝ arianyɩŋmumuŋyǝ sa la kǝmaakǝ we, cɔkɔŋyǝ lée fii nuŋtumuwǝ, kɛɛnyɔŋyǝ lǝŋ tǝ ŋ nyɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Wǝŋɔŋkpǝ wǝ loh mǝ ru rǝ yulaarǝ wǝ ŋ pǝ wǝ ŋ tɔɔlʊ kǝ okopiyǝ we yǝ kpii rǝ oŋuŋkǝ yǝ tikili. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Eniyǝ we yǝ láa nyɩŋ kǝ́ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋ náa sʊʊ rǝ aŋɔɔyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ mǝ okopimumuŋyǝ mǝ wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Lée kpii epicoŋpipǝ ŋ maŋ, kǝ ŋ ca epǝ we ŋ na saa ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ rǝ ǝrǝkǝ kpǝlo siri po ku rǝ, ŋ ku, fǝ ǝrǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ le nyiŋwǝ ko yulaarǝ la kǝkpaakǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la kaŋ otuyǝ lo ru rǝ wǝcookpǝ rɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-36">Matewu 24:32-36</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Nǝ karǝ otuyǝ nǝ ru rǝ dierǝ sa ŋ́ nah tɛŋ ŋ́ ca mǝ wǝcookpǝ wǝ. Vǝ́ wǝcookpǝ la alaŋyǝ yǝ la tarǝ, wǝ́ yǝ lo ru eweyǝ we, nǝ nyǝ ŋ ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ aŋʊŋtɛniyǝ yǝ lǝ kǝlǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Kaa wǝǝ vǝ́ nǝ nya pa nyɩŋ otuyǝ sa yǝ ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ we, nǝ ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi lǝ ǝpǝkǝ kǝ lǝ kǝlǝ, wǝ́ ŋ yaa rǝ nǝ guŋpolurǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, rǝkǝsa le enyipǝ pǝ lǝŋ pǝ kpǝ́ pǝ lɛ kpɛŋ kǝ otuyǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ ci ǝpǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Yulaarǝ mǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ yǝ lah pa tɛlɩ, paa mǝ etieyǝ yǝ lǝŋ pa tɛlɩ kʊrakʊra.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rɛ lee ci eniyǝ we Kulǝtǝyǝ ŋ nǝh pǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matewu 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Paa mǝŋ jirǝ we amaa eniyǝ we otuyǝ sa yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ we, rɛ ri ŋ rɛ lee ci yǝ, mǝŋ epicoŋpipǝ rǝ yulaarǝ, mǝŋ Piyǝ. We Tǝyǝ ceŋceŋ ko ŋ cii yǝ wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Nǝ yee yurǝ, nǝ saanǝ nǝ tii nǝ mǝ rǝŋ. Duturǝ ɖi nǝ nyee ci eniyǝ we otuyǝ sa yǝ lǝh pǝ pǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Wǝ tǝ wǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ noh ko gʊŋrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ na nyarǝwǝ ŋ ne kpii na asʊmatǝpǝ rǝ akaakǝ pǝ ŋ yɩrɩ. Wǝ́ ŋ no koonu nyi ri ŋ nyi mǝ na kǝnǝnɛkǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi yǝ we ŋ née tii mǝ ŋ rǝŋ guŋpolurǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ kpaka ŋ tii mǝ ŋ yɩrɩ wǝ eni ri ŋ ni. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kǝto nǝ saanǝ nǝ tíi nǝ mǝ rǝŋ, duturǝ ɖi nǝ nyee ci eniyǝ we nyarǝlǝtǝyǝ we ŋ nah pa siɛnɩ ŋ pǝ wǝ. Ayɩrɛ ɖiɔrǝ amaa dumukururǝ amaa vǝ́ kʊkɔyǝ lǝ kpǝǝ amaa ɖokoŋpirǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ŋ poo po somu nǝ ŋ pǝ kǝ oturu nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kpɛɛ eniŋrieyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Dierǝ sa ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ we, ŋrǝ ke wǝ́ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nyi ri ŋ nyi, ǝkǝnǝŋ nǝ paa kpɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Pǝ le ri nyuŋkpǝ pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matewu 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowanɛsɩ 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Wǝ tùuru juu yi kǝ pǝ ri eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ mǝ kpɔnɔyǝ we pǝ lee kpii dafaŋrǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ. Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ ka ŋ taa kʊŋwǝ kǝ pǝ ŋwaa pǝ lɔ Yesu, kǝ pǝ wʊ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Duturǝ ɖi pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rɛ ŋ pee yee wǝ mǝ wǝcɛkpǝ sa le eniyǝ, mǝŋ ŋkǝ kɔɔ wǝǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ kǝ leh pe kpii gasarǝ».<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tieyǝ rɛ lo co apɔŋfɛŋfɛŋpǝ le fieni Yesu rǝ yurǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matewu 26:6-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 7:36-38">Luka 7:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu ke tini rǝ Sɩmɔ yǝ we pǝ lóo pwo nyarǝpimwɛɛrɩlǝtǝyǝ la nyarǝwǝ rǝ Betania. Wǝ́ tieyǝ rɛ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rù, anyɩŋ Yesu ya lée ri. Tieyǝ sa ke re bʊrʊŋtwapirǝ rɛ pǝ lǝ fǝ ɖurǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Alǝbatǝrǝyǝ pǝ le yee wǝ. Bʊrʊŋtwapirǝ we ge kpii mǝ apɔŋfɛŋfɛŋpǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Narǝyǝ. Apɔŋpǝ sa pǝ lóo ru okuruyǝ ŋpa. Wǝ́ tieyǝ we ŋ nyàa bʊrʊŋtwapirǝ we lo nyuŋkpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ apɔŋpǝ we ŋ fìeni Yesu rǝ yurǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wǝ́ wǝ fìi enyirɛɛpǝ, wǝ́ pǝ ke ŋ tíi awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ apɔŋfɛŋfɛŋpǝ sa ŋ nǝ pǝlǝ ǝnǝ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Pǝ koh koru esiiri apɔŋpǝ sa mǝŋ sɩkakpotokpotoyǝ tuuruta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɩkamumuŋyǝ rɛ ŋ kǝ lǝǝwe, ŋpǝ mǝ nǝnɛyeetǝyǝ la wǝcɛŋtookpǝ wǝ kaa rǝ.</char></note> mǝ otuyǝ, kǝ pǝ fǝ ŋwǝ pǝ koonu ariariatǝpǝ.» Wǝ́ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ kpaŋ mǝ tieyǝ we ŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Paape wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ maa ŋwǝ. Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kpaŋ mǝ ŋwǝ wǝ? Kǝnǝnɛceeceekǝ rɛ wǝ́ ŋ ne yee ŋ no koonu mǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Duturǝ ɖi ariariatǝpǝ pǝ kpii pǝ kʊla mǝ nǝ eni ri ŋ ni, nǝ nyóo koru eyee pǝ le wǝceeceekpǝ mǝ eniyǝ we nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. Ŋmǝ paa we, ŋ́ nǝŋ kpii rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ kǝkpakǝkpa. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Tuwǝ we tieyǝ sa ŋ nóo koru eyee we, ŋ wǝ wǝ́ ŋ ne yee ǝnǝ. Lo coŋ opo nuŋ mǝ kǝwɛlɛŋfwɛɛkǝ la apɔŋfɛŋfɛŋpǝ lǝ tǝnǝ jiŋwaarǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ rǝ, anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ rǝ ǝrǝkǝ sa kpǝlo pǝ lah mǝ tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ sa we, pǝ lah mǝ tɛŋ tuwǝ sa tieyǝ sa ŋ yeli wǝ, kǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ ŋ taalǝ ŋwǝ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda leh siiri Yesu ŋ koonu otoolutǝpǝ lo omumuŋpǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matewu 26:14-16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Wǝ́ Yuda Isǝkario, yǝ we ŋ ri enyikpiipǝ we le ceŋceŋ, ŋ kolu ŋ nyɩnɩ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ Yesu ŋ kpii pǝ rǝ akaakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Kǝ́ pǝ lo nuŋ Yuda Isǝkario le etieyǝ sa we, wǝ́ pǝ nyà faawǝ ŋpa. Wǝ́ pǝ cò na garǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ lóo koonu na sɩkayǝ. Wǝ́ Yuda ŋ ka ŋ taa kʊŋwǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ Yesu ŋ kpii pǝ rǝ akaakǝ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu le ri eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Matewu 26:17-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Kpɔnɔyǝ we pǝ lee kpii dafaŋrǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ le jisǝsǝŋrǝ ɖi jirǝ pǝ láa wʊ amɛɛpipǝ pǝ ŋ ri eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu lo otukarǝtǝpǝ sa pǝ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Fǝŋ wǝ́ ǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ la ka caa eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ le keeriwǝ lo koonu lǝ́?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ kpìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ eyi, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ mǝ ko tǝŋtǝǝwǝ. Nyiyǝ rɛ ŋ re mɛŋwǝ mǝ wǝpwɛŋkpǝ loh po ku mǝ nǝ. Nǝ siimǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Nyarǝwǝ we ŋ neh ke fii we, nǝ tìi nyarǝlǝtǝyǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Tukaŋtǝyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, gukpǝ we ŋ neh pe tii ŋ ri eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ le keeriwǝ ŋpǝ mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Láa kaŋ nǝ guyɔkɔɔkpǝ rɛ rǝ baŋsʊrʊyǝ. Pǝ lo toolu kpǝ pǝ lǝ tǝnǝ. Tu ri ŋ tu wǝ kpɛlɩ rǝ gukpǝ we. Fɛɛwǝ nǝ nyah ka caa nǝ koonu lǝ wǝǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ pǝ ko ŋ ko tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we. Kǝ́ pǝ le ke fii we, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ tu ri ŋ tu mǝŋ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ càa eyinyapǝkǝ le keeriwǝ we.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Kǝ́ wǝ lo ro ɖiɔrǝ we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ fìi ŋpǝ mǝ enyikpiipǝ we pǝlǝ tǝ mǝ eyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Kǝ́ pǝ tini pǝ lée ri we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tìi nǝ wǝ, rɛ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ lǝh fǝ mǝ ŋ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ. Yǝ we tini lée ri mǝ mǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ fìi gʊʊpirǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ Yesu rǝ tɛɛ rǝ tɛɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋmǝ ŋ́ lǝǝwe?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋnǝ enyikpiipǝ sa tǝ mǝ eyi le ceŋceŋ ŋ lǝǝwe. Yǝ we tini lée kpii akaakǝ mǝ ŋ ri rǝ kǝsiɛkǝ sa mǝ mǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ lo ru rǝ ŋwǝ wǝ. Paa yǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi ŋ kpii enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ we, na paapɔ mǝ na aria. O koh nuŋ pǝ lǝǝ mǝ yǝ we kʊraa we, wǝ koh poŋ ŋwǝ wǝ teeri.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝ ne enyikpiipǝ pǝ le ri keerikenikeniwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matewu 26:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Okorɛŋtotǝpǝ 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Eniyǝ we pǝ tini pǝ lée ri we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ fǝ̀ kpɔnɔyǝ. Kǝ́ ŋ ne ceeni Worokoyǝ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ pò kpɔnɔyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ kòonu no otukarǝtǝpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ lɔ, wǝ ǝnǝ wǝ ri mǝ kǝwɛlɛŋfwɛɛkǝ». <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ kɔpʊwǝ wǝ kpii mǝ vɛŋyǝ. Kǝ́ ŋ ne ceeni Worokoyǝ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ vɛŋyǝ we ŋ kòonu pǝ, wǝ́ pǝlo kpǝlo pǝ ŋunu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ǝnǝ wǝ ri mǝ ŋpǝrayǝ. Ŋpǝrayǝ sa wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ ŋ na tɛɛ gaapirǝ rǝ ne dierǝ we ŋ na parǝ ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ rǝ ŋpǝ mǝ enyipǝ le kǝtiitiikǝ. Ŋpǝrayǝ sa ŋ na lʊ rǝ enyipǝ wa lo yurǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ, rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, ŋ́ nǝŋ tǝ ŋ́ po ŋuŋ vɛŋyǝ, ko ro jirǝ we ŋ́ nóo ŋuŋ vɛŋŋwɛŋyǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ we mǝrǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Kǝ́ Yesu mǝ no otukarǝtǝpǝ pǝ la nɔŋ oworokonɔŋyǝ we pǝ láa nɔŋ rǝ eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ pǝ la lɛ we, wǝ́ pǝ rù pǝ ko ŋ ko oliviepǝ lo dutupirǝ we.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu le tíi Pɛtǝro ǝkǝnǝŋ lǝh pǝ sǝ́ŋ ŋwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matewu 26:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowanɛsɩ 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ nǝ nyáa maa mǝ nǝ co. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ la ŋʊrʊ rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">“Ŋ́ náa wʊ mɛɛrǝŋtǝyǝ we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">kǝ amɛɛpǝ we pǝ suu pǝ caŋ awɛ”.<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Paape vǝ́ ŋ́ na saanǝ ŋ́ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋ́ nóo coŋ ŋ́ ka ya mǝ ŋ rǝŋ nǝ rǝ Galileya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ke ce wǝ ri enyipǝ kpǝlo pǝ la maa lǝ́ pǝ lo co we, ŋmǝ paa ŋ́ nǝŋ yee wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi lǝ́ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, kpɛŋ kǝ kʊkɔyǝ ŋ pǝ kpǝǝ kǝyi ruŋruŋ mǝ dumurǝ sa we, ǝ lǝ́ǝ sǝ́ŋ mǝ o co pǝrǝŋwǝ kǝta.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Paape wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tǝ ŋ ka ŋ nyɩɩ mǝ ŋ tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ke ce wǝ ri ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋmǝ ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ ŋ́ kʊla mǝ lǝ́ we, ŋ́ nǝŋ pǝ sǝ́ŋ lǝ́ ŋ́ co.» Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝtuturupǝ we ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ tɛnɩ wǝ mǝŋkɔɔwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ya láa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ rǝ Gecemanɩ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matewu 26:36-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ pwɛyɩ pǝ kolu pǝ fìi fɛɛwǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Gecemanɩ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi no otukarǝtǝpǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ tíi rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa, kǝ ŋ́ ko ŋ́ ka mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Wǝ́ ŋ rè Pɛtǝro, Yakubu mǝ Yowanɛsɩ ŋ kolu. Wǝ́ ŋ tìe vumumuŋrǝ rɛ le efiikǝ mǝ kǝǝnǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ ne fii gʊʊpirǝ mǝŋ ŋ́ kpǝ́ rǝ! Nǝ tii rǝ sa, nǝ saanǝ nǝ tii nǝ mǝ rǝŋ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Wǝ́ ŋ sanǝ ŋ rùu ŋ kolu tɩpɩrɩ, wǝ́ ŋ sʊ̀ʊ ŋ kpɛlɩ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ ŋ ka ŋ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ mǝŋ wǝ lóo poŋ kǝ arianyɩŋyǝ le eniyǝ yǝ ruu yǝ cɛ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «O, mǝ Tǝ, o lóo koru tu ri ŋ tu le eyee, maa arianyɩŋyǝ la kɔpʊwǝ sa wǝ ruu wǝ cɛ rǝ mǝ kpǝŋ! Paa yee rǝ lǝ́ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ, ŋkǝ mǝ nɛŋwǝ oo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kǝ́ ŋ na siɛnɩ ŋ no po tuu otukarǝtǝpǝ we atapǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tùru kǝ́ pǝ la kpɛɛ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ sàanǝ Pɛtǝro ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Sɩmɔ, a ya láa kpɛɛ eniŋrieyǝ? E lee ce o koru ǝfǝ eniyǝ buŋrǝ jeŋceŋ a saanǝ e tii ǝ mǝ rǝŋ? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Nǝ tii nǝ mǝ rǝŋ, kǝ nǝ mǝ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ, kǝ nǝ paa nya fɛɛ nǝ fii rǝ gbǝǝrǝ. Nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ yee tuceeceewǝ paape lǝǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ rùu ŋ kolu, wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ mwɛnɩ nyuŋkpǝ we ke. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ sìɛnɩ ŋ pǝlǝ, wǝ́ ŋ nyɩnɩ pǝ, pǝ ya pǝ láa kpɛɛ eniŋrieyǝ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ loo ko ŋ koru owuru enimiyǝ pǝ re, wǝ́ pǝ laa lɛ pǝ ci dierǝ pǝ leh tíi Yesu wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Kǝ́ ŋ nǝ tǝ ŋ na siɛnɩ ŋ nǝ pǝ kǝtatǝkǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ tǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa kpɛɛ nyǝ ŋ wɛɛ rǝ? Wǝ la kaa ǝnǝ. Eniyǝ yǝ lo ro rǝkǝsa. Nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ, pǝ lǝh fǝ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi pǝ kpii oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ rǝ akaakǝ! <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Nǝ yi, kǝ lo ko. Nǝ yɩrɩ re, yǝ we ŋ nǝh fǝ mǝ ŋ kpii pǝ rǝ akaakǝ lo po ru!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ la lɔ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matewu 26:47-56</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Eniyǝ we Yesu ŋ tǝ ŋ ya ŋ náa wɛɛlɩ we, wǝ́ enyikpiipǝ we le ceŋceŋ pǝ lóo pwo Yuda ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rù kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ ŋpǝ mǝ nyikpǝŋmumuŋwǝ rɛ wǝ re atʊkʊyǝ mǝ eleŋkpeyǝ. Otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ pǝ le kpii pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudayǝ sa ŋ kǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ kpii pǝ rǝ akaakǝ tìi pǝ tǝ̀nǝ tuwǝ we ŋ neh pe yee ŋ kaŋ pǝ wǝ. Tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ we ŋ́ noh ko puru we, ŋwǝ ŋ lǝǝwe. Nǝ lɔ ŋwǝ nǝ mǝ ko, kǝ nǝ mǝ yɩrɩ ŋwǝ sɩsiɛrɩ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Kǝ́ Yuda ŋ ne pe fii ko we, wǝ́ ŋ rùu ŋ kǝlǝ mǝ Yesu. Wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Tukaŋtǝyǝ!» Wǝ́ ŋ pùru ŋwǝ, <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />wǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ tà Yesu, wǝ́ pǝ lɔ̀ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we le ceŋceŋ ŋ fǝ̀ na tʊkʊwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fùru toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we la sʊmatǝyǝ wǝ́ ŋ ràarǝ no kǝtukoŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ nyóo ko ru mǝ atʊkʊyǝ mǝ eleŋkpeyǝ nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ nǝ pa lɔ mǝ mǝŋ nyɩwʊʊlʊtǝyǝ rɛ wǝ́ ŋ́ ri. <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ji ri ŋ ji ŋ́ náa kaŋ otuyǝ rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ, nǝ nyǝǝ pǝ nǝ pa lɔ mǝ. Paape wǝ lǝ pǝ ǝnǝ kǝ etieyǝ we pǝ la ŋʊrʊ pǝ le kpii rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ mǝrǝ yǝ pǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we kpǝlo pǝ sùu pǝ màa ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Wǝ́ kosopiyǝ rɛ ŋ sìimǝ Yesu ŋ ko ŋ ko. Nyaŋrǝ ko wǝ́ ŋ ke sìi. Wǝ́ pǝ lɔ̀ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Paape wǝ́ ŋ nyàrǝ nyaŋrǝ we ŋ cò, wǝ́ ŋ sùu ŋ ko ŋ ko kǝtaŋkpa.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ lo ko mǝ Yesu rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ la fɛɛtɛŋakpaŋyǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matewu 26:57-68</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yowanɛsɩ 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ Yesu pǝ kolu toolutǝmumuŋyǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ kpǝlo mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kù. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ sìimǝ Yesu ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ rǝ kǝmaakǝ rǝ nɔ wǝ́ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ fìi ǝrǝ toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we la nyarǝwǝ le etikeŋtikǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ sɔ̀ ŋ tini rǝ asʊmatǝpǝ we lǝ kpǝŋ ŋ ke ŋ wii naawǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ we mǝ Oyudatǝpǝ la akpaŋtɛŋtǝpǝ la wǝcakumumuŋkpǝ we kpǝlo we, pǝ ka ŋ taa dierǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ tɛɛ rǝ ŋwǝ kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ tɔɔ na gbɛŋpɔrǝ. Paape pǝ laa ka ŋ nya dierǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Duturǝ ɖi enyipǝ wa pǝ ka ŋ nia etieyǝ pǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ ŋwǝ. Paape pǝle etieyǝ we yǝ laa ka ŋ kaa mǝ awɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Arɛɛpǝ pǝ yili pǝ nìa pǝ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Yǝ lóo nuŋ ya láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Ŋ́ náa wɔɔ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ sa anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ lǝ fǝ pǝla wǝkaakpǝ pǝ la tɔ wǝ, kǝ rǝ juu ta lǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋ́ siɛnɩ ŋ́ tɔ wǝpʊŋpwakpǝ enyipǝ pǝ lǝǝ fǝ pǝla wǝkaakpǝ pǝ tɔ wǝ.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Paape pǝle dierǝ sa pǝ la tɛŋ ke laa kaa mǝ apʊŋpwapǝ la nɛŋrǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Wǝ́ toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we ŋ yili rǝ enyikpǝlo le enimiyǝ wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ Yesu ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A lǝŋ tɛŋ tǝrɛ o ru rǝ etieyǝ sa enyipǝ sa pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛŋ pǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ lǝ́ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Paape wǝ́ Yesu ŋ rǝnǝ kpiri, lǝǝ kpǝlǝŋ ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we ŋ tǝ ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ e ri Mesiyayǝ, Worokoyǝ we yǝ láa sʊma le Piyǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tɛ̀ɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝŋ, ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ ri. Nǝ nyah pa nyɩŋ Nyɩmaasɩ le Pi tini rǝ Woroko Kopilǝtǝyǝ le kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ, kǝ nǝ nyɩŋ lo ru rǝ yulaarǝ láa sʊʊ rǝ aŋɔɔyǝ lǝ mǝrǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Wǝ́ toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we ŋ fǝ̀ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ŋ làarǝ na wǝkpakpǝ wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ lǝǝ tǝ lǝ pǝ́ ɖaŋsielǝtǝyǝ rɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nǝ nyoo nuŋ busuŋtǝtierǝ sa? Nǝ nya nyɩŋ wǝ nɛ?» Wǝ́ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ tɔɔ na gbɛŋpɔrǝ wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ wǝ kaamǝ kǝ ŋ kpǝ́. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Wǝ́ arɛɛpǝ pǝ yili pǝ ko ŋ toopǝ otutomiyǝ pǝ ŋ fieni ŋwǝ. Pǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ tuwǝ pǝ ŋ parǝ na anyɩŋkǝ ǝ pǝ ŋ tuu na akpaŋkʊyǝ. Oturu pǝ lǝ pǝ́ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyɩŋ yǝ we ŋ na ca lǝ́ e tíi lǝ». Wǝ́ ǝrǝŋtǝpǝ we pǝ ka ŋ waarǝ na akaafieliyǝ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtǝro la cwɩɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ nee ci Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matewu 26:69-75</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yowanɛsɩ 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Eniyǝ we Pɛtǝro ŋ ke tini rǝ etikeŋtikǝ we rǝ pɔɔlʊwǝ we, wǝ́ toolutǝmumuŋyǝ we la sʊmatǝtieyǝ ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rù. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Kǝ́ ŋ na nyɩŋ Pɛtǝro ŋ tini ŋ née wii naawǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ yɩrɩ ŋwǝ pʊrɩpʊrɩ, wǝ́ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlá ŋkpɛ a ka kʊla mǝ Nazarɛtǝtǝ Yesu». <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ cwɩ̀ɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ noo nuŋ wǝlo dutu, wǝ́ ŋ́ naa lɛ ŋ́ ci dierǝ lǝ ɖǝ a ya láa tɛŋ wǝ». Wǝ́ ŋ rù ŋ kolu ŋ yàa rǝ etikeŋtikǝ we lo guŋpolurǝ. Wǝ́ kʊkɔyǝ ŋ kpǝ̀ǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊrɛɛkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Wǝ́ sʊmatǝtieyǝ we ŋ nyɩnɩ ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ tǝ ŋ ke ŋ tíi enyipǝ we pǝ ka yaa rǝ we ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝle ceŋceŋ ǝyǝǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tǝ ŋ cwɩ̀ɩ wǝ. Wǝ laa panǝ wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ ka yaa rǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ tǝ pǝ ke ŋ tìi Pɛtǝro ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝceece, enyipǝ we le ceŋceŋ wǝ́ e ri, duturǝ ɖi Agalileyatǝpǝ wǝ́ e ri.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ no tu, ŋ́ nee ci nyiyǝ sa le dierǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyáa tɛŋ wǝ. Mǝŋ ŋ́ náa nia rǝ we, we Worokoyǝ ŋ ta mǝ kǝtukoŋkǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Kǝtǝrǝceŋceŋ, wǝ́ kʊkɔyǝ ŋ kpǝ̀ǝ kǝyitǝkǝ. Wǝ́ Pɛtǝro ŋ tàalǝ tuwǝ we Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpɛŋ kǝ kʊkɔyǝ ŋ pǝ kpǝǝ kǝyi we, ǝ lǝ́ǝ sǝ́ŋ mǝ o co pǝrǝŋwǝ kǝta.» Wǝ́ ŋ yà ŋ ke ŋ wee piripiri.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Pǝ lǝ fǝ Yesu pǝ lo ko Pilato lǝ kpǝŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matewu 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yowanɛsɩ 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Kǝ́ kǝ la nya kǝ la kaalǝ we, wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ we pǝ kù mǝ ǝtǝŋtǝǝtǝmumuŋpǝ mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ mǝ Oyudatǝpǝ la wǝkpaŋtɛŋtǝcakumumuŋkpǝ we le enyituturupǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ. Wǝ́ pǝ pàrǝ Yesu. Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ kolu pǝ kpìi Pilato rǝ akaakǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ e ri Oyudatǝpǝ le piliyǝ?» Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋlǝ́ a ya a láa tɛŋ wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ we pǝ ka ŋ nia etieyǝ wa pǝ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A lǝŋ tɛŋ tǝrɛ? Yɩrɩ etieyǝ sa kpǝlo pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛŋ pǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ lǝ́ re.» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Paape Yesu lǝǝ tǝ ŋ kpǝlǝŋ ŋwǝ, wǝ́ wǝ rili Pilato lo mumuŋ.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ la tɔɔ Yesu la gbɛŋpɔrǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matewu 27:15-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yowanɛsɩ 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Vǝ́ pǝ lah nya pǝ ŋ ri eyinyapǝkǝ la wǝcɛkpǝ rɛ ko we, Pilato ŋ nyarǝ kukpɛɛtǝyǝ rɛ ŋ co ŋ koonu Oyudatǝpǝ. Yǝ we Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ lǝ pǝ́ pǝ nyarǝ pǝ co pǝ koonu pǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Pǝ lɔ̀ nyiyǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Baraba mǝ nǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ pǝ tanǝ. Pǝ yili pǝ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ Oromatǝpǝ, wǝ́ pǝ wʊlʊ nyiyǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Wǝ́ nyikpǝŋwǝ we wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ tìi Pilato ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ yee tuwǝ we ŋ née ce mǝ ŋ yee, ŋ koonu pǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ pǝ̀ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ ŋ́ nyarǝ Oyudatǝpǝ le piliyǝ ŋ́ co ŋ́ koonu nǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Duturǝ ɖi ke cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ kǝǝkpǝlǝwǝ kǝto wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ pǝ fǝ̀ Yesu pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ kpìi ŋwǝ rǝ akaakǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Wǝ́ otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ pǝ ke ŋ kpii nyikpǝŋwǝ we lo otukoŋyǝ kǝ pǝ tìi Pilato ŋ nyarǝ Baraba ŋ co ŋ koonu pǝ bomu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ tǝ ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝkǝsa kǝ́ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee mǝ nyiyǝ sa nǝ ya nǝ nyóo pwo ǝkǝnǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ le piliyǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Wǝ́ pǝ tǝ pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ woolu pǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpaa ŋwǝ a maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ pǝ̀ pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Rǝkǝsa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ ŋ ne yee?» Wǝ́ pǝ tǝ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ nyɩɩ pǝ ŋ woolu ŋpa ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kpaa ŋwǝ a maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Wǝ́ Pilato ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ ŋ taarǝ nyikpǝŋwǝ we lo turuwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ nyàrǝ Baraba ŋ cò ŋ kòonu pǝ. Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ ŋ kòonu pǝ cùlu Yesu mǝ fwɛɛpǝlawǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ kpìi pǝ rǝ akaakǝ pǝ ka kpaa pǝ maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuusiitǝpǝ pǝ la mɔɔnʊ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matewu 27:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yowanɛsɩ 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Wǝ́ otuusiitǝpǝ we pǝ fǝ̀ Yesu pǝ fìi kǝŋyɩrɩtǝyǝ we la nyarǝwǝ le etikeŋtikǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ pwò otuusiitǝpǝ lǝ kpǝŋwǝ kpǝlo. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ kǝkpakpurumukǝ rɛ kǝ mwɛɛrɩ pǝ kpìi ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ yàa bilituurǝ rɛ mǝ owuyǝ pǝ sìi ŋwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Wǝ́ pǝ yà pǝ ke ŋ ceeni ŋwǝ pǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yudatǝpiliyǝ, tii vɔrʊrǝ kǝkpakǝkpa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ gáarǝ rɛ pǝ ko ŋ culu ŋwǝ rǝ yurǝ. Pǝ ko ŋ toopǝ otutomiyǝ pǝ ŋ fieni ŋwǝ, wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ pǝ ŋ kʊŋ ŋwǝ pǝ ŋ tɔ kǝtukǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Kǝ́ pǝ la mɔɔnʊ ŋwǝ pǝ la lɛ we, wǝ́ pǝ pɔ̀rʊ kǝkpamwɛɛrɩkǝ we. Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝŋwǝ na wǝkpakpǝ pǝ sìɛnɩ pǝ kpìi ŋwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko pǝ ka kpaa pǝ maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ la kpaa Yesu pǝ la maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matewu 27:32-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yowanɛsɩ 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Nyiyǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo Sɩmɔ ŋ no ru rǝ Sirɛnǝ rù rǝ atɛɛkǝ pǝlǝ ka ŋ tɛlɩ. Alɛsaŋto mǝ Rufu lǝ tǝ ŋ kǝ lǝǝwe. Wǝ́ otuusiitǝpǝ we pǝ rǝ̀ǝrǝ Yesu la kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ we pǝ tɛ̀ɛ ŋwǝ mǝ okopi mǝ okopi. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko fɛɛwǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Golǝgata, wǝlo duturǝ wǝ ri «Yufoopiwǝ la fɛɛwǝ». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wǝ́ pǝ fǝ̀ cukuluwǝ rɛ pǝ lóo pwo «Mirǝyǝ» pǝ kʊ̀la mǝ vɛŋyǝ pǝ kòonu ŋwǝ ŋ ŋuŋ. Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ sǝnǝ.<verse eid="MRK 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ, wǝ́ pǝ kpàa ŋwǝ pǝ màarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ cò eciiyǝ pǝ sǝ̀pǝ na wǝkpakpǝ, kǝ pǝ ci tuwǝ we nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ nah lɔ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ɖokoŋpirǝ le eniyǝ faŋceŋceŋ wǝ́ pǝ kpàa ŋwǝ pǝ màarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Dierǝ we pǝ fǝ̀ pǝ tɔ̀ɔ Yesu la gbɛŋpɔrǝ we, pǝ ŋʊ̀rʊ rǝ pǝ tɛ̀ɛ rǝ ɖurǝ rɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Oyudatǝpǝ le piliyǝ». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Wǝ́ pǝ kpàa ayɩlayɩtǝpǝ eyi ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ màarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ. Ceŋceŋ rǝ ne kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ, ceŋceŋ rǝ na kǝpɛŋsiɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Kǝ́ wǝ yeli wǝ́ dierǝ we pǝ la ŋʊrʊ rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ bǝlǝ wǝǝ. Pǝ ŋʊ̀rʊ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝ lǝ kǝ ŋwǝ pǝ la kʊla mǝ enyirɔɔrɔɔpǝ».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛwǝ sa wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ ka ŋ tɛlɩ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ ka ŋ fɛɛpɩ ŋwǝ. Pǝ ke ŋ tikili yurǝ pǝ ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Hɛ! Ŋkǝ ŋlǝ́ a ka ŋ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ a láa wɔɔ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ, kǝ a siɛnɩ a tɔ wǝ rǝ juu ta lǝ mǝrǝ? <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Ŋlǝ́ŋlǝ́ pɔrʊ lá wɛ, kǝ a sʊʊ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ sa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Otoolutǝmumuŋpǝ we mǝ esekaŋtǝpǝ we ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ mɔɔnʊ ŋwǝ pǝ ŋ tíi awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Lóo koru enyipʊŋpwapǝ la apɔrʊ, paa lǝŋ koru ŋwǝŋwǝ na wɛ la apɔrʊ. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Mesiyayǝ, Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpiliyǝ, sʊʊ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ sa rǝkǝsa rǝkǝsa, kǝ la nyɩŋ, kǝ la nya fɛɛ la lɔ lo nuŋ.»<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lǝ kpǝ́</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matewu 27:45-56</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yowanɛsɩ 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kǝ́ cɔkɔŋyǝ ŋ ne tii zaarǝ we, wǝ́ kǝtǝǝwǝ kpǝlo wǝ fìi nuŋtumuwǝ ko ro ǝrǝ ɖiɔrǝ eniyǝ ta. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Kǝ́ eniyǝ ta yǝ la ca we, wǝ́ Yesu ŋ cà narǝwǝ mǝ okopiyǝ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabaktani?» Wǝlo duturǝ ɖi «Mǝ Worokoyǝ, mǝ Worokoyǝ kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a la maa mǝ o lo co wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Kǝ́ epǝ we pǝ ka yaa rǝ fɛɛwǝ we la arɛɛpǝ pǝ lo nuŋ ŋwǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «A la nyɩŋ, ya lóo pwo Eliya». <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Wǝ́ enyipǝ we la rɛɛyǝ ŋ sùu ŋ kolu ŋ fǝ̀ tutuuwǝ ŋ kpìi rǝ vɛŋnyarǝyǝ wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ wǝ ŋ pàrǝ rǝ gáarǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋ ko ŋ koonu ŋwǝ ŋ ŋuŋ. Wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ maa ŋwǝ kǝ la nyɩŋ mǝŋ Eliya lǝ́ǝ pǝ ŋ pa sʊʊrʊ ŋwǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ sa wǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Wǝ́ Yesu ŋ cà narǝwǝ kelele, wǝ́ ŋ kpǝ̀. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Wǝ́ nyaŋrǝ we pǝ fǝ̀ pǝ sǝnǝ fɛɛkenikeniwǝ we rǝ Worokoyǝ la nyarǝwǝ làrǝ kpee yi ru rǝ oŋuŋkǝ pa sʊʊ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Kǝ́ romatǝtuusiitǝmumuŋyǝ we ŋ ka yaa rǝ Yesu la kǝnyɩŋkǝ ŋ na nyɩŋ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ we, wǝ́ ŋ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝceece, nyiyǝ sa ke ri Worokoyǝ le Piyǝ fee.» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Etiepǝ rɛ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ ka yaa rǝ nɔ pǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ pǝ ŋ maŋ. Ŋpǝ pǝ kaamǝ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala, Yose mǝ Yakubu pipiyǝ we le lee Marɩya, mǝ Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ ke kpii rǝ Galileya we, ŋpǝ etiepǝ sa pǝ ke siimǝ ŋwǝ wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ no yurǝ mǝ arɛɛpǝ pǝ sìimǝ ŋwǝ pǝ kolu Yerusalɛmǝ wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝ la ka ŋwaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matewu 27:57-61</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowanɛsɩ 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ɖiɔrǝ ɖò, wǝ́ kǝ́ wǝ ke ri jirǝ we wǝ́ pǝ láa kpaka sabatǝyǝ we, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />wǝ́ Yosɛfʊ ŋ no ru rǝ Arɩmata ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ rù. Ke ri akpaŋtɛŋtǝpǝ we le ceŋceŋ. Pǝ lóo pu ŋwǝ ŋpa. Ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ kǝ ŋ rǝŋ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ tù turuwǝ ŋ kolu Pilato lǝ kpǝŋ ŋ kolu ŋ pǝ̀ Yesu le kǝnyiǝtǝkǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Wǝ́ wǝ rili Pilato lo mumuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu la marǝ ǝkpǝ́. Wǝ́ ŋ kpìi pǝ pwò otuusiitǝpǝ lo mumuŋyǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ ŋwǝ mǝŋ Yesu lǝ kpǝ́ wǝ la panǝ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Kǝ́ otuusiitǝpǝ lo mumuŋyǝ we ŋ ne tìi nǝ wǝ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ ŋ pɔ̀rʊ gʊŋrǝ ŋ kòonu Yosɛfʊ ŋ kǝ fǝ Yesu le kǝnyiǝtǝkǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Wǝ́ Yosɛfʊ ŋ fùu tucokpɛɛwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ŋ sʊ̀ʊ mǝ Yesu rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ we. Wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ tucokpɛɛwǝ we ŋ mìli ŋwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ kolu ŋ kpìi rǝ wǝfuŋkpǝ rɛ pǝ nyini rǝ ɖutɛɛrǝ rɛ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ pǝ̀ǝlǝ ɖumumuŋrǝ rɛ ŋ tanǝ wǝfuŋkpǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Wǝ́ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala mǝ Marɩya Yose le leeyǝ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ yɩrɩ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ la kpɛɛlɩ ŋwǝ wǝ.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la saanǝ rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matewu 28:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yowanɛsɩ 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Kǝ́ sabatǝyǝ le jirǝ la pa tɛlɩ we, wǝ́ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala mǝ Yakubu le lee Marɩya mǝ Salome pǝ fùu apɔŋfɛŋfɛŋpǝ pǝ ko nuŋ Yesu le kǝnyiǝtǝkǝ we. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Kɔsɩrayǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɔsɩrayǝ ŋ kaamǝ kuluwǝ le jisǝsǝŋrǝ.</char></note> lo ɖokoŋpirǝ ŋalaŋala we, wǝ́ pǝ pǝlǝ wǝfuŋkpǝ we la fɛɛwǝ, anyɩŋ cɔkɔŋyǝ lo poŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Wǝ́ pǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ awɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝlǝ ŋ nǝh kǝ pǝǝlǝ ɖurǝ we pǝ lǝ fǝ pǝ la taŋ wǝfuŋkpǝ we ŋ koonu lǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kǝ́ pǝ le yiili anyɩŋkǝ eni we, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ rɛ lǝ pǝǝlǝ ɖurǝ we la cɛ. Paa ɖurǝ we ga naanǝ ŋpa. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Wǝ́ pǝ fìi wǝfuŋkpǝ we lǝ mǝrǝ, wǝ́ pǝ nyɩnɩ kosopiyǝ rɛ le kpii kǝkpakpɛɛlɩkǝ tini rǝ kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ cɩ̀ɩlɩ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Wǝ́ kosopiyǝ we ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ paa cɩɩlɩ. Nǝ ya nǝ nyáa taa Nazarɛtǝtǝ Yesu, yǝ we pǝ kpàa pǝ màarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ? Lee kpii rǝ fɛɛwǝ sa, la saanǝ. Nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ kpɛ̀ɛlɩ ŋwǝ wǝǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nǝ mǝ ko nǝ ke tíi no otukarǝtǝpǝ mǝ Pɛtǝro ǝkǝnǝŋ lo coŋ la tɛlɩ Galileya ŋ ke tii mǝ ŋ rǝŋ nǝ. Fɛɛwǝ we wǝ́ nǝ nyah ka nyɩŋ ŋwǝ, mǝŋ kǝ́ ŋ tìi nǝ wǝ kǝtǝ.» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Wǝ́ pǝ rù rǝ wǝfuŋkpǝ we pǝ sùu, duturǝ ɖi vurǝ vìi pǝ ŋpa wǝ́ pǝ yà pǝ ka ŋ ca kpakpa. Kpiikǝ pǝ yà pǝ ko ŋ suu vurǝ kǝto pǝ lee tíi rɛ la tǝrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Les femmes voient que la tombe a été ouverte" file="10R.TIF" size="col" copy="Mbanji Bawe Ernest" ref="16:4">Etiepǝ rɛ pǝ la ka nyɩŋ kǝ́ pǝ lǝ pǝǝlǝ ɖumumuŋrǝ we pǝ la cɛ rǝ Yesu lo wǝfuŋkpǝ we wǝ</figure>
  </para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu la pɔrʊ na wɛ la kaŋ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matewu 28:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yowanɛsɩ 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fǝ rǝ fɛɛkǝwǝ 9 ko 20 wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Kǝ́ Yesu ŋ sàanǝ ŋ rù rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ mǝ Kɔsɩrayǝ we we, pɔ̀rʊ na wɛ kanǝ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala kpɛŋ. Ŋwǝ Marɩyayǝ sa lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pìri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ apǝrɩmata wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Wǝ́ Marɩya ŋ no ru rǝ Magǝdala ŋ fǝ̀ ŋ kolu ŋ tìi epǝ we pǝ ka kʊla mǝ Yesu wǝ́ pǝ yà pǝ ke ŋ wee pǝ ŋ nʊmʊ wǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kǝ́ enyipǝ we pǝ lo nuŋ Marɩya ŋ na tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu kpii vɔrʊrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ na lɛ ŋ na nyɩŋ ŋwǝ we, pǝ laa lɔ pǝ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ Yesu ŋ pɔ̀rʊ na wɛ ŋ kanǝ enyi eyi rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ rǝ wǝlǝpʊŋpwakpǝ rɛ. Enyipǝ sa eyipǝ pǝ ko ŋ ko atɛɛkǝ rǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Wǝ́ ŋpǝ enyipǝ sa ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ sìɛnɩ pǝ pǝlǝ pǝ tìi otuturupǝ lǝ wǝ. Paape pǝ laa lɔ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ ŋ pɔ̀rʊ na wɛ ŋ kanǝ enyikpiipǝ we tǝ mǝ ceŋceŋ mǝ eniyǝ we pǝ ke tini pǝ ke ŋ ri wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kpanǝ mǝ pǝ mǝ kǝ́ pǝ lɛnyɩ yurǝ wǝ́ pǝ laa lɔ pǝ nuŋ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ laa lɔ epǝ we pǝ la nyɩŋ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Wǝ́ ŋ tìi pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ mǝ ko ǝrǝkǝ kpǝlo nǝ ka tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ we nǝ tíi enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yǝ we ŋ náa lɔ ŋ nuŋ, kǝ pǝ wiiri no worokomɛŋwǝ we, yǝ we láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ. Paa yǝ we ŋ nǝŋ lɔ ŋ nuŋ we, lǝŋ nya alɔkuŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Epǝ we pǝ láa lɔ mǝ pǝ nuŋ we, apayǝ sa ǝnǝ yǝ lée siimǝ pǝ: Pǝ leh mǝ piri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ rǝ mǝ nyɩŋrǝ. Pǝ lah mǝ wɛɛlɩ kǝrǝŋwɛŋkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Pǝ lóo koru ata wǝpɔɔkpǝ mǝ pǝla wǝkaakpǝ, pǝ lóo koru oŋuŋ wǝpwɛkpǝ tǝrɛ wǝ lǝŋ yee pǝ. Pǝ lah mǝ tɛɛ anyaatǝpǝ la akaakǝ ǝ pǝ ŋ kpaa.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la rɛ yulaarǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Anǝnɛyeeyǝ 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Kǝ́ Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu ŋ na wɛɛlɩ ŋ ne tíi pǝ ŋ na lɛ we, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ ka ŋ rɛ yulaarǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ kolu ŋ tini rǝ ne kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Wǝ́ otukarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ pwɛ̀yɩ pǝ kolu pǝ ka ŋ tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ we rǝ fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ. Kulǝtǝyǝ ko ŋ toŋ pǝ wǝ́ ŋ ka ŋ tɛɛ ɖurǝ rǝ ne dierǝ saŋ rǝ otuyǝ we yǝ lóo co vurǝ pǝ ke ŋ yee wǝ.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>